ps://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-notifications/commits/ca48e34d43cbc3ab3d7962ee132243256c18cbec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T16:06:08Z","email":"adolfo@axim.org","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T16:06:08Z","email":"arbrandes@arbrand.es","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"message":"chore: add dev/test site configs and app.scss (Phase 5)\n\nRegister the notifications App in site.config.test.tsx and add a\nsite.config.dev.tsx that mounts the shell/header/footer apps plus a\nstub authenticated page so the bell can be exercised in dev mode.\napp.scss pulls in the shell stylesheet. Replace the legacy\npublic/index.html template, which still referenced process.env and\nhtmlWebpackPlugin.options (both unavailable under frontend-base), with\na minimal static one. Move the dev port from 2002 (taken locally) to\n1992.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9afd506fa18e64bb4008029c37702691be72f80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-notifications/git/trees/f9afd506fa18e64bb4008029c37702691be72f80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-notifications/git/commits/ca48e34d43cbc3ab3d7962ee132243256c18cbec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.