https://api.github.com/users/g5l/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g5l/web-playground/commits/1489b3cdc957b86bbcfc65492a684d1d075d4898/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T02:15:08Z","email":"gabriel.debona@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel Debona"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T02:15:08Z","email":"gabriel.debona@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel Debona"},"message":"phase 1: database schema, auth session, seed scripts, login routes and pages\n\nPrisma schema for User/Team/Match/Bet/AuditLog with enums, indexes, and FK\nrelations. Initial migration SQL generated from scratch. PrismaClient\nsingleton in lib/db.ts.\n\niron-session config (wc26_session cookie, 30-day TTL) with typed SessionData.\nrequireUser/requireAdmin guards for server-side auth checks.\n\nSeed scripts: prisma/seed.ts creates admin from ADMIN_EMAIL/ADMIN_PASSWORD env\nvars; scripts/seed-teams.ts upserts all 48 WC2026 teams with flag emojis.\n\nAuth API routes:\n  POST /api/auth/login       participant login (invite code + name)\n  POST /api/auth/admin-login admin login (email + bcrypt password)\n  POST /api/auth/logout      destroys session\n  GET  /api/auth/me          returns session user or 401\n\nLogin pages at /login and /admin/login using Mantine forms. Landing page\nredirects to /login. Turbopack root config corrected for Next.js 16.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98402153259edcc6618e15d31d9bd0934a8e0692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g5l/web-playground/git/trees/98402153259edcc6618e15d31d9bd0934a8e0692"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g5l/web-playground/git/commits/1489b3cdc957b86bbcfc65492a684d1d075d4898","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":