debona@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel Debona"},"message":"add @apply vs extract POC\n\nThree columns, same button: @apply outside @layer (unlayered beats all\nutilities so overrides silently lose), @apply inside @layer components\n(utilities win but you end up writing them inline anyway), and the\ncomponent model where variants are props and zero CSS is written per\nvariant. Live override attempts prove each claim.\n\nAlso surfaces the @reference \"tailwindcss\" requirement for standalone\nCSS files using @apply in Tailwind v4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b02db7bc2b4c8efb8c18078b4ef71f90441f2cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g5l/web-playground/git/trees/b02db7bc2b4c8efb8c18078b4ef71f90441f2cab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g5l/web-playground/git/commits/495eda48a3798c909e6c64b5512b7d2461f48080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20099133?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/g5l","id":20099133,"login":"g5l","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDk5MTMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g5l","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/g5l/web-playground/commit/495eda48a3798c909e6c64b5512b7d2461f48080","node_id":"C_kwDONyzmMtoAKDQ5NWVkYTQ4YTM3OT