s to it, and polling stops while it waits.","tree":{"sha":"bf7c7769d66565e74f39a1f0f34c676a87319bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/bf7c7769d66565e74f39a1f0f34c676a87319bc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/4d7cb17812eef16b9d313996f02c13361a58b9bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/4d7cb17812eef16b9d313996f02c13361a58b9bd","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDRkN2NiMTc4MTJlZWYxNmI5ZDMxMzk5NmYwMmMxMzM2MWE1OGI5YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/f67edc095a59557b3f8f79395718c4c67c8da2d6","sha":"f67edc095a59557b3f8f79395718c4c67c8da2d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/f67edc095a59557b3f8f79395718c4c67c8da2d6"}],"sha":"4d7cb17812eef16b9d313996f02c13361a58b9bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/4d7cb17812eef16b9d313996f02c13361a58b9bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/f67edc095a59557b3f8f79395718c4c67c8da2d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:23:49Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:23:49Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"feat(alb): link every fix, add records to a zone, share hostname chips\n\nFollow-up to the wildcard hostnames work.\n\n- Records panel: lighter layout spanning the row, with Name and Value as\n  labelled rows. Once the certificate is issued, a missing Certificate\n  record reads as needed for renewal rather than a warning.\n- Add to zone writes a required CNAME or TXT into the Datum zone, or\n  replaces a record holding its name. If the create fails, the replaced\n  records are put back, and only records that can be put back are ever\n  replaced. Nothing is offered until the zone''s records have loaded.\n- Pointers are links: Fix hostnames, View configuration, Open domain,\n  and Request wildcards (a pre-filled support message) instead of \"see\n  the Configuration tab\" or \"contact Datum\".\n- The default hostname shows Active when only a blocked custom hostname\n  holds the ALB back, and polling stops in that state.\n- Hostname chips are one shared component for the Configuration list and\n  the Overview. The TLS card shows On hold for blocked hostnames.\n- One rule for which domain covers a hostname, with trailing dots handled.","tree":{"sha":"ef9fffd3aa2a50ecac3bbe79ebd075ac936f22b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/ef9fffd3aa2a50ecac3bbe79ebd075ac936f22b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/f67edc095a59557b3f8f79395718c4c67c8da2d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","u