,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:17:26Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"feat(alb): show passive health checks again\n\nThe Health checks card, the outlier detection stat and the overview''s\n\"Passive health checks\" label were hidden because the edge never applied\nthe setting. network-services-operator#558 fixed that, and a failing\nendpoint is now ejected on staging, so the flag that hid them goes.","tree":{"sha":"793278d491e58d67cc4d47d424d6c7ac0ade3299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/793278d491e58d67cc4d47d424d6c7ac0ade3299"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/ee178e603a607295eb2c8fd9638c159213b0b597","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/ee178e603a607295eb2c8fd9638c159213b0b597","node_id":"C