eneric puzzle piece in the portal\ninstead of the brain icon it asks for. The portal only recognises a\nfixed list of icon names and quietly falls back to the puzzle piece for\nanything else. Brain wasn''t on that list, so this adds it. Any plugin\nthat asks for the brain icon will now get it.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Typecheck passes\n- [x] Lint and formatting pass\n- [ ] In staging, the Patch AI dock trigger shows a brain icon\n- [ ] Other plugin icons in the sidebar and dock are unchanged","tree":{"sha":"fab7149451f168d7ce1e98cbbff30156393d4dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/fab7149451f168d7ce1e98cbbff30156393d4dd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/1589fd5990e9c854469fd48b44581529167bcf25","verification":{"payload":"tree fab7149451f168d7ce1e98cbbff30156393d4dd4\nparent 4debd424f122d999f767fc0b5b2d304c8d5d652c\nparent 5f1fe0ca2581583c1fe6773350dc986a35a2b93a\nauthor Matt Jenkinson <75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com> 1791378804 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791378804 +0100\n\nfix(plugins): show the brain icon plugins ask for (#1647)\n\nThe Patch AI chat dock shows a generic puzzle piece in the portal\ninstead of the brain icon it asks for. The portal only recognises a\nfixed list of icon names and quietly falls back to the puzzle piece for\nanything else. Brain wasn''t on that list, so this adds it. Any plugin\nthat asks for the brain icon will now get it.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Typecheck passes\n- [x] Lint and formatting pass\n- [ ] In staging, the Patch AI dock trigger shows a brain icon\n- [ ] Other plugin icons in the sidebar and dock are unchanged","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxkV0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHkkQAJoG4YdyoCcFNJsfSudunu54\n21Us5wL06Ait4kgGU8AwXUZHapj/RLennxJOAsHavGGFbm54xCek9gvrNSd5n8PZ\npuUtuBsYAM/w6KG0PThe/HOG7BDVgAdGki2JgdG5R9XnOkDDdq0gCoiAfYtTkhsQ\nVR10I8PkLFWAAe+vVddqzYEWl1NawEBMJjH8VXVN2iQRe4+