 paint with the same timing. The name step also stops\ntelling email and passkey users that GitHub only shared a username.","tree":{"sha":"8769a4f8946c51a31d2729a2523065986d4c72a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/8769a4f8946c51a31d2729a2523065986d4c72a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/4fbb75a8351b1b1115dce0a1f311f84e3862079e","verification":{"payload":"tree 8769a4f8946c51a31d2729a2523065986d4c72a5\nparent d778c4f3771b0f4de3e60369453fc4400a8a79c7\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791364439 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791364439 +0700\n\nfix(onboarding): show the step card on first paint\n\nThe onboarding card faded in through a motion component, which\nserver-renders at opacity 0 and needs JavaScript to reveal it, so a slow\nor failed hydration left new users on a blank page. A CSS entrance now\nruns on first paint with the same timing. The name step also stops\ntelling email and passkey users that GitHub only shared a username.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmrGDVcbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4j5hcQAKQBLFGvfQZrs0xwir8Y\nlS7gZ8aX+HEeomQafOhbI3bVcaTLMZ4cRNnEKZHov6LOhyMCyp++kxsQLIZi2L9A\njgtVDsaACBqlytn/eCufB0ERj2aIaDS4FJsHJlsHbMyTcAJvqAAK69ldmOrjgICI\nQ7IDkZKzfwSFnazupkkZCI0k8KjI0DpO0cJTFrugzkdIQ7kBdKHqHiNBOK58ppb/\nuFb8ewQ02c8NEEQccP6B2mcCTrfb2nkpX3wUGE8WYz/vRuL7Rb0dB01ujfPYA/1M\nrp5Wuh/90zFUTQXz6ZY9iQF+0x78rooMdJUl/t0+jrRR00XR+JtEHtBESXaCSZQR\nDlXJtHmgS51XeQQRPStegPkTgeIWNL+D8CyLWeP6YRWax0EUpeuMixLpEJq7ojkP\nnkoviCNY/IxF++NEWB0oLeE1/h/mB7z2PhiNoyOTxHxbpsbG5vUa6CeTqtyPbN+b\ny6XdUbQswdZ4e2Txk5FkB7Ku0lHrCWiC56MrVzqprjw6pQdut48E7eujdzPTbQhZ\nX0hIg3uQOLjtQurkuR1N3FxSITrpJWWZsKDm2uMun9JmRobyRZ6Sm415Nl61CYFw\nFESb/PLzrexmOPGvP7XxXx59G9pjCLlmfkpCkRYcD9DjAia/9OkzOOlTPqXkzo5T\nan0ufU2jbmJJVaHq/KmAYAY6\n=/oMj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verifie