ttps://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yahyafakhroji","id":3510868,"login":"yahyafakhroji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA4Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/d778c4f3771b0f4de3e60369453fc4400a8a79c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:13:59Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:13:59Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"feat(auth): recover requests that race a token refresh\n\nZitadel revokes the old access token as soon as a refresh rotates the\nsession, so a request still holding it got a 401 and the user was\nsigned out. Each refresh now records a 60-second link from the old\nrefresh token to the newest session, and server-side calls that get a\n401 retry once with the current token and pass the new cookies on. The\nrefresh coordination code moves into its own module to keep\nauth.service under 800 lines.","tree":{"sha":"6de9a179ecef0c9794886ea0ea8821a2197dca2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/6de9a179ecef0c9794886ea0ea8821a2197dca2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/d778c4f3771b0f4de3e60369453fc4400a8a79c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 6de9a179ecef0c9794886ea0ea8821a2197dca2f\nparent 6f8b06964404ea0669d9fbc499f65686b4b7ae0d\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791364439 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791364439 +0700\n\nfeat(auth): recover requests that race a token refresh\n\nZitadel revokes the old access token as soon as a refresh rotates the\nsession, so a request still holding it got a 401 and the user was\nsigned out. Each refresh now records a 60-second link from the old\nrefresh token to the newest session, and server-side calls that get a\n401 retry once with the current token and pass the new cookies on. The\nrefresh coordination code moves into its own module to keep\nauth.service under 800 lines.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmrGDVcbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4jL+QQAL1DABCpQTaCciEdLUQz\nOBvdf+l+5m+BZwzCJosNB6H8WfUdTeCe0UVZqKeb0qmY7+uFcxXT4DNor56P/iBW\nho+RXSCRJkyDIXB+7UamdLRYwgBiAqJfKSUIQdLUbkaeEwIQMhPq6byN0pRwoFYz\nNHChv3X6r3ErLGR8FQ1GwGERljJidPNrUhxdUhrfqKR2CRsbP5MMEZMbnore3oxr\n9GVR/dpJNfmtehBK2vIJtP8XMnt4StlHV5YwulXS5Baler98k+Vxk7MU51QXQ9yb\nDHupwAuyQq0hpmraNis82YrYVbpn+z+7o+CTZzQjrLd9M6vnghxh2o4a9c4KVOW+\nqg3g2NoYL+7qr/1zTCifDA3wqJ2/hmPlC5z73/g44LkA5XtvBrcoqNoxQRpIoUY8\n1tuTqq2OkSD9eRT3tDM3aujlxNyJmzDtEk8C/PjWOZnnB9IVdekFDEdRe+6ID80h\nHXpP6Jei8XKXPZO/XWTFGg0wG5nAocqVtBNEqVrzAdVeYAHgX6w1Qcpu//POdmTU\nbfmTg7mLveK8cMoqah1YxPa4nKF4QpVtM85C7t9twejZg4no2Uv21z25yg5k2vF9\nrF3VDs6zQFpi9zessyZ4WwnWyBzX8xMQdcws/bk6FQC3dui9JNZhlpqWc3D5k5x5\naXJx8Cj4QVJyxZd2uDbY/GMl\n=KUik\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T09:14:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3510868?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co