fakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/6f8b06964404ea0669d9fbc499f65686b4b7ae0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:13:58Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:13:58Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"fix(onboarding): read the user once per request\n\nThe onboarding layout forced a token refresh while the step loaders\nwere still reading the user with the old token. Zitadel invalidates the\nold access token on refresh, so the step loaders got a 401 and logged\nthe user out. The loaders now share one user read and one org probe per\nrequest, and nothing in onboarding forces a refresh.","tree":{"sha":"db51748ad6da848572f60b737bf77157a124036b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/db51748ad6da848572f60b737bf77157a124036b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/6f8b06964404ea0669d9fbc499f65686b4b7ae0d","verification":{"payload":"tree db51748ad6da848572f60b737bf77157a124036b\nparent 743d8e0200aacb56768f4e342161a819689c04c4\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791364438 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791364438 +0700\n\nfix(onboarding): read the user once per request\n\nThe onboarding layout forced a token refresh while the step loaders\nwere still reading the user with the old token. Zitadel invalidates the\nold access token on refresh, so the step loaders got a 401 and logged\nthe user out. The loaders now share one user read and one org probe per\nrequest, and nothing in onboarding forces a refresh.\n\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYP