4763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/743d8e0200aacb56768f4e342161a819689c04c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:07:51Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:07:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Domain page: drop CloudValid, clearer manual verification, one page (#1643)\n\nPart of #1642. The CloudValid flow hid the manual TXT steps, and the\npage showed nothing until verification data arrived.\n\nThis drops CloudValid and puts manual verification at the top, with each\nmethod''s last check result and a Check now button. Activity, Settings\nand notes fold into the overview, old tab links redirect, and the commit\nmessage lists every change.\n\nBefore\n<img width=\"1288\" height=\"988\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/936a3b87-9803-4c43-9945-5524f25abe8b\"\n/>\n\n\nAfter\n<img width=\"1288\" height=\"988\" alt=\"Screenshot From 2026-10-06 10-57-35\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/538e7ce8-eb3e-4c04-ac3c-e4fa9202d2af\"\n/>\n\n\n## Changes\n\nRemoved:\n- CloudValid automatic verification: the card, the /api/cloudvalid\nroute, app/modules/cloudvalid, and the CLOUDVALID_* env vars. Infra\nstill sets those vars; they are now ignored.\n- Activity and Settings tabs and the tab bar. Old /activity and\n/settings URLs redirect to the overview. Delete lives in the header.\n\nManual verification (top of the page while unverified):\n- Always shows the TXT and HTTP methods with an OR divider. Values not\ngenerated yet show \"Generating...\". A ValidDomain=False rejection shows\nthe operator''s message in an alert.\n- Shows the last check result per method and \"Last checked X ago, next\ncheck in Y\".\n- Check now sets spec.desiredVerificationRefreshAttempt, with the same\n5-minute cooldown as Refresh. Adds useRefreshDomainVerification and\nshares one patch helper with the registration refresh.\n\nDetails table:\n- Denser rows, fixed label column, muted labels.\n- Status badge moved to the page header.\n- Notes moved into a table row (NotesSection became inline NotesList).\n- DNS Host shows \"None found\" once the lookup has run, instead of\n\"Looking up...\" forever.\n- Created At is relative.\n- \"Transfer to Datum\" renamed \"Set up DNS zone\"; the header button says\n\"Set up DNS Zone\" when no zone exists.\n\nActivity: compact digest feed for this domain, moved from the old tab.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Typecheck, lint, unit tests\n- [ ] Cypress domains spec deletes from the header button\n- [ ] Unverified domain: records, check results, Check now and its\n5-minute cooldown\n- [ ] Verified domain: verification panel hidden, header badge shows\nVerified","tree":{"sha":"4c77c4f8c42466688534297c1d74837bdd16dc95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/4c77c4f8c42466688534297c1d74837bdd16dc95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/743d8e0200aacb56768f4e342161a819689c04c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 4c77c4f8c42466688534297c1d74837bdd16dc95\nparent 46390274dfddc0c79a8cc13935f0bbc9bfd1abe6\nparent 4d40ee287ee2e47e77b45081d32d4e65ba995dbd\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791335271 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791335271 -0700\n\nDomain page: drop CloudValid, clearer manual verification, one page (#1643)\n\nPart of #1642. The CloudValid flow hid the manual TXT steps, and the\npage showed nothing until verification data arrived.\n\nThis drops CloudValid and puts manual verification at the top, with each\nmethod''s last check result and a Check now button. Activity, Settings\nand notes fold into the overview, old tab links redirect, and the commit\nmessage lists every change.\n\nBefore\n<img width=\"1288\" height=\"988\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/936a3b87-9803-4c43-9945-5524f25abe8b\"\n/>\n\n\nAfter\n<img width=\"1288\" height=\"988\" alt=\"Screenshot From 2026-10-06 10-57-35\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/538e7ce8-eb3e-4c04-ac3c-e4fa9202d2af\"\n/>\n\n\n## Changes\n\nRemoved:\n- CloudValid automatic verification: the card, the /api/cloudvalid\nroute, app/modules/cloudvalid, and the CLOUDVALID_* env vars. Infra\nstill sets those vars; they are now ignored.\n- Activity and Settings tabs and the tab bar. Old /activity and\n/settings URLs redirect to the overview. Delete lives in the header.\n\nManual verification (top of the page while unverified):\n- Always shows the TXT and HTTP methods with an OR divider. Values not\ngenerated yet show \"Generating...\". A ValidDomain=False rejection shows\nthe operator''s message in an alert.\n- Shows the last check result per method and \"Last checked X ago, next\ncheck in Y\".\n- Check now sets spec.desiredVerificationRefreshAttempt, with the same\n5-minute cooldown as Refresh. Adds useRefreshDomainVerification and\nshares one patch helper with the registration refresh.\n\nDetails table:\n- Denser rows, fixed label column, muted labels.\n- Status badge moved to the page header.\n- Notes moved into a table row (NotesSection became inline NotesList).\n- DNS Host shows \"None found\" once the lookup has run, instead of\n\"Looking up...\" forever.\n- Created At is relative.\n- \"Transfer to Datum\" renamed \"Set up DNS zone\"; the header button says\n\"Set up DNS Zone\" when no zone exists.\n\nActivity: compact digest feed for this domain, moved from the old tab.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Typecheck, lint, unit tests\n- [ ] Cypress domains spec deletes from the header button\n- [ ] Unverified domain: records, check results, Check now and its\n5-minute cooldown\n- [ ] Verified domain: verification panel hidden, header badge shows\nVerified","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxZtnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvMUQAFr+hfGv1Z9XDEvXZ+g8jOWU\nK+CqGlXwNDHNGNAisGFmAptwRKDbiEjig8QERlg5lAXDREQuR3WdHMdftUAdHVXW\n3+bwoVWK0SGHp8fQ7gDWZsdQV8LDyIOVgzx5HUo+38T1id/rYba1XNUt1YYz3dl+\nS5Kb1pvOVwzNnFDLjgpl9CH8DQhdf/CFX4jMldUqfBB2vZlsZdFZgqUFmBZa+4ST\nGBNcg+NUCNmj+fMl+b2WAQDTo0S5x8j0q02AK0wKk1AWUqqnKFG9fy3wMKNiM7WD\nMrXJuxLt6xwQao2xQS8d6ideDoa3KI803icq7QN37DNdHBQV7B7ePFE1++Rjncei\nNMW7ERxfUCbRfgqtYI9v4kRBQzfz2uQ9J7wsL1Mh/mR1/lxDR/iL9Km9aIOhSLor\narB7aXIUA3fyevtjmWh+x5ORydmLgZ3mAXmbv04KYEg6BYmYEl1oWkMlwRLcOrEZ\njTs2LggLPXa1vVxLho3GapHu3robv68PUmK5arQsRLxXmWbDd0/rWvQbLg1XJC1S\nIPvPCjSmKFsdqSzxD12L963tIf+5YtYGkuEjwuKaS1haWJa+hXaPfTeMe7dQ9d7+\nMKyw8vruHFcPwo0YGUpgfiw3/jbjhi2uSxfXcorDNEdyTn+3oUNoC/BQdDtUMzPA\nKayx1y1ThqdyPEr5pgns\n=+k8i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T01:07:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url