om/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/f978d846bf1b878d89adf11b5449bb055ace287d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:02:52Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:03:26Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat(domains): rework the domain overview page\n\nRemoved:\n- CloudValid automatic verification: the card, the /api/cloudvalid\n  route, app/modules/cloudvalid, and the CLOUDVALID_* env vars. Infra\n  still sets those vars; they are now ignored.\n- Activity and Settings tabs and the tab bar. Old /activity and\n  /settings URLs redirect to the overview. Delete lives in the header.\n\nManual verification (top of the page while unverified):\n- Always shows the TXT and HTTP methods with an OR divider. Values not\n  generated yet show \"Generating...\". A ValidDomain=False rejection\n  shows the operator''s message in an alert.\n- Shows the last check result per method and \"Last checked X ago,\n  next check in Y\".\n- Check now sets spec.desiredVerificationRefreshAttempt, with the same\n  5-minute cooldown as Refresh. Adds useRefreshDomainVerification and\n  shares one patch helper with the registration refresh.\n\nDetails table:\n- Denser rows, fixed label column, muted labels.\n- Status badge moved to the page header.\n- Notes moved into a table row (NotesSection became inline NotesList).\n- DNS Host shows \"None found\" once the lookup has run, instead of\n  \"Looking up...\" forever.\n- Created At is relative.\n- \"Transfer to Datum\" renamed \"Set up DNS zone\"; the header button says\n  \"Set up DNS Zone\" when no zone exists.\n\nActivity: compact digest feed for this domain, moved from the old tab.\n\nPart of #1642","tree":{"sha":"3a09e6557613fb87c3eef85b5678cd0d143da134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/3a09e6557613fb87c3eef85b5678cd0d143da134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/f978d846bf1b878d89adf11b5449bb055ace287d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a09e6557613fb87c3eef85b5678cd0d143da134\nparent abb51d2fd1b1e1a3378301899f09a099fd7046ce\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791309772 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791309806 -0700\n\nfeat(domains): rework the domain overview page\n\nRemoved:\n- CloudValid automatic verification: the card, the /api/cloudvalid\n  route, app/modules/cloudvalid, and the CLOUDVALID_* env vars. Infra\n  still sets those vars; they are now ignored.\n- Activity and Settings tabs and the tab bar. Old /activity and\n  /settings URLs redirect to the overview. Delete lives in the header.\n\nManual verification (top of the page while unverified):\n- Always shows the TXT and HTTP methods with an OR divider. Values not\n  generated yet show \"Generating...\". A ValidDomain=False rejection\n  shows the operator''s message in an alert.\n- Shows the last check result per method and \"Last checked X ago,\n  next check in Y\".\n- Check now sets spec.desiredVerificationRefreshAttempt, with the same\n  5-minute cooldown as Refresh. Adds useRefreshDomainVerification and\n  shares one patch helper with the registration refresh.\n\nDetails table:\n- Denser rows, fixed label column, muted labels.\n- Status badge moved to the page header.\n- Notes moved into a table row (NotesSection became inline NotesList).\n- DNS Host shows \"None found\" once the lookup has run, instead of\n  \"Looking up...\" forever.\n- Created At is relative.\n- \"Transfer to Datum\" renamed \"Set up DNS zone\"; the header button says\n  \"Set up DNS Zone\" when no zone exists.\n\nActivity: compact digest feed for this domain, moved from the old tab.\n\nPart of #1642\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrFN+4ACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j0OohAAjnoYF8YfPq9O8zORV/dQ+XKBE+Lx+t7NFPK2Mai9hIJ/g4g5+hzkcGBS\nGCFOfOat8dC7de4xiDiqKJ6Bl6sPQ97vTuyhmXVOYYeXsTlUNXKsXYBn+t3m0NIh\nWg9m4KeSiLbxeEAoD/7WLE3LTbcUEt9bFhASghhc75Van4ljN3JJ5klhgfStEbdI\nBm4BZD1r8vlsoF5SSiPcRN3nHFuYECMXwqEW5Ff9evR8hFnqJTg9uuhHWJw/YQjH\nbUyKnpeBKhen8ODdZb0vBRYTmQGsTrcnWUgRjcAik7dKe8cKUfzz4D0o8CmEIYrz\nyC0SYvbWqSJ/xtt+0J2TCHGvoP43N7ld5IIoG3P5cvaphGajRNrfdK2zBG1+t3bn\nShZ6S4BY1HlMp+N2cNeoaIOiMRuZ86MsKQiY60UAbyf+71VLRm7m6cM2tE9np4kl\nM5k7n82sJQaGYNd/3z6tuFaS+iIiYG/tnian4dKp4+eYSrAUncCylMKl0qoYteuV\nyMAG1VtSCT/nqtC99ocN0osoz3SlP7m8ZS0iERsKp1Q42TLDmMLlPK6VfmnaCssJ\na6ckRf+Nc9Hpf2Goi+X/SX4ZCjV37iEuB7AINn/btgk8q1DvRXPx8OiOTjEZ+3Aq\nbNMVurEBf6pP/vcIyOPh3sAWB/39nMammkEi708/CCIGu9JuvEM=\n=70D4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T18:03:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html