s://github.com/yahyafakhroji","id":3510868,"login":"yahyafakhroji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA4Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/744dae2f6eb2b972c9cbe3f8dd6bf7b2e74907bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:45:53Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:25:07Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"fix(watch): keep hub upstreams alive and relay subscribes across pods\n\nUpstream watches could end while idle and never restart, missed events\nwere never signalled, and a subscribe that landed on the other replica\nfailed for good. The hub now restarts and backs off upstreams per user,\nsends a resync event whenever a channel may have missed changes, and\ncan relay subscribes through Redis behind WATCH_RELAY_ENABLED.","tree":{"sha":"8716fd53098f1b2a564dde284bc57685fb92cba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/8716fd53098f1b2a564dde284bc57685fb92cba8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/744dae2f6eb2b972c9cbe3f8dd6bf7b2e74907bf","verification":{"payload":"tree 8716fd53098f1b2a564dde284bc57685fb92cba8\nparent 6252783b6986a6048f1524b5ed51ca8afcb92847\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791247553 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791253507 +0700\n\nfix(watch): keep hub upstreams alive and relay subscribes across pods\n\nUpstream watches could end while idle and never restart, missed events\nwere never signalled, and a subscribe that landed on the other replica\nfailed for good. The hub now restarts and backs off upstreams per user,\nsends a resync event whenever a channel may have missed changes, and\ncan relay subscribes through Redis behind WATCH_RELAY_ENABLED.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmrEXAMbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4j8GsP/0IvXVAEUe9FGyS/M+ID\n65R/MF3bV/yqUtpo9ZrtdDCOt/5yDMiv7WYqlzncNIZHBFOly8971NxDM3a/48gI\nK2ijJMb2l0sDHzh+oPiewJt0pkyTC5RQSvGbsswalJX1WLpcy7eAHD+bOuAYj811\nmkBxFQJQKkyP8zOa/qnkZqj90bbVaN6mYM/L19ujmBfL2YShcSG5ussqn9LNQYX3\n2qNvKAVMBfhBT2NkooVwfhYHRgVl++uHjQVuxo8jo1+LTaZXhMleMbe/m7NguN62\nTi/a9ReEMVtocjNbxTxENFmd9YRb+8lh9URcuBvyHXQKZ/5SIOshYl7mYFU9vWOE\nWpdKMokhe8P8wd3AtomBA/1wt5yOue9G67CJd709eQ7+4nFWLPgfNj4O/akoUAvF\nW6S8X+kCBXPrMBBH1y3kwzbmhOhGOPJExQNWg8lgQS3S22BqE5L9bwzdiufFeV5q\npl6rUdMOs+hqpIpTJwAjqflU8+btCVh2GYkPhBATXE93VrUKwx9ZkhUws/eRkH7a\ni13dAGTlTD3m8CxiZyyN6v66AH3IVtidIU13btZx06JWyn/zG7Z6KRCW5uBQzDqV\nsLR4xaJ0Ipaf1FeJ8UVl6/NXCbWTr1ePyd2FcuH0j6fv4pA5Bz6dwhkwOvneSTHk\nSqh9Iy9rMFjE0RzYOBYvqmDl\n=WB4i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T02:27:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3510868?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yahyafakhroji","id":3510868,"login":"yahyafakhroji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA4Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/744dae2f6eb2b972c9cbe3f8dd6bf7b2e74907bf","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDc0NGRhZTJmNmViMmI5NzJjOWNiZTNmOGRkNmJmN2IyZTc0OTA3YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/6252783b6986a6048f1524b5ed51ca8afcb92847","sha":"6252783b6986a6048f1524b5ed51ca8afcb92847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/6252783b6986a6048f1524b5ed51ca8afcb92847"}],"sha":"744dae2f6eb2b972c9cbe3f8dd6bf7b2e74907bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/744dae2f6eb2b972c9cbe3f8dd6bf7b2e74907bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/6252783b6986a6048f1524b5ed51ca8afcb92847/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:33:35Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:33:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf: Make the portal''s first page load smaller and faster (#1637)\n\nA first visit to any portal page downloads 0.97 to 1.2MB of compressed\nJavaScript before the page can respond. This cuts that by 300 to 600KB\nper page. Login goes from 971KB to 382KB.\n\n- Pages stop loading the editor, chart and markdown libraries they don''t\nuse.\n- Each page loads its stylesheet once instead of twice, saving about\n300KB on every first visit.\n- The payment library loads once the page is idle, and the support\nwidget loads when someone opens it.\n- The note editor loads when someone starts editing.\n\nTo check on staging:\n- [ ] Adding a payment method works\n- [ ] \"Get in touch\" opens on the first click\n- [ ] Editing a load balancer description and adding a note both work","tree":{"sha":"89c68461aa91c6c55a96e30662137f03c19c8098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/89c68461aa91c6c55a96e30662137f03c19c8098"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/6252783b6986a6048f1524b5ed51ca8afcb92847","verification":{"payload":"tree 89c68461aa91c6c55a96e30662137f03c19c8098\nparent 25fe2b2f47001f70c8f45d30156af7ce23dae4fc\nparent 996e4c80e59c89dac16c59ff041f702f7399eace\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791243215 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791243215 -0700\n\nperf: Make the portal''s first page load smaller and faster (#1637)\n\nA first visit to any portal page downloads 0.97 to 1.2MB of compressed\nJavaScript before the page can respond. This cuts that by 300 to 600KB\nper page. Login goes from 971KB to 382KB.\n\n- Pages stop loading the editor, chart and markdown libraries they don''t\nuse.\n- Each page loads its stylesheet once instead of twice, saving about\n300KB on every first visit.\n- The payment library loads once the page is idle, and the support\nwidget loads when someone opens it.\n- The note editor loads when someone starts editing.\n\nTo check on staging:\n- [ ] Adding a payment method works\n- [ ] \"Get in touch\" opens on the first click\n- [ ] Editing a load balancer description and adding a note both work","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxDPPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzdAQAIj+1CK42+vR5m/TZC6QebsN\nR2NYcPWiPZzIzEsQAEDwBYSo42d5jl0r7JoTHT2Rm+Mgd9BqS2ARFFoV0Cnejaq4\n7waboZiy8mwTGF+kyQ4NC8HrZnQuuKjx0+gwQtzOA05HAhoknMJoY0aOkcsJVKZY\n//7pHnXIoGmtGpmsB3NkC1TakfaDNOr3aLZ3BvNYpppfBvfD1L1gu+3LWQMfw2I6\nUwZmi1C3f1YZ+pGUn2LkkIZA4qQB+GmE2YsmHftui3wr9E4k5WQHiPrCGqLN1Lt5\noM8zCRpAUHWZBnbYugT0H1ehzWim5P7yOmxNm58xi90L5SkmDdI2jpgHas5f/8JY\ncfnf2sRz8ilXtekVuy2Ngiocek1STiBTWHG1rUv02bXIoRDrJQOQTRe7h8rNd615\nwWojSfRiSmh9m6o6Db1xLJhdO+HEKPrLtIuuWR/XyzLnWc+4GpGnqp0tQ265929H\nSYBGJNk1QTAFC5ttidOfUjH0fYdTa1k51miWdMufofbpuSJd/+a+IWHV2lY9D0W9\nbClNNXyQ+Cl0aS+ZYtSUHs46pNwT1+fbZizmPseLEVphVdmL4W0snNBvGGFBmGSm\nUwAar2tHKt2UKOYAIQgRWT/Hh4pWQBtngYyspGNb5am6RrqTiR7NLk3wIfk9FBu7\nvX/bz76MYqS/JoecHvQZ\n=00lK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T23:33:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repo