thub.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/25fe2b2f47001f70c8f45d30156af7ce23dae4fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:18:14Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:18:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Turn on compression for portal pages and scripts (#1638)\n\nThe compression change in #1636 never took effect. The gateway accepted\nthe setting but silently skipped it, because each compression type needs\nits own settings block, even an empty one. Staging still sends every\npage and script uncompressed.\n\nThis adds the empty settings blocks.\n\nAfter it reaches staging:\n- [ ] Scripts arrive Brotli-compressed","tree":{"sha":"d84983d6c06b7a2635edc1c6a1254b763f499b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/d84983d6c06b7a2635edc1c6a1254b763f499b81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/25fe2b2f47001f70c8f45d30156af7ce23dae4fc","verification":{"payload":"tree d84983d6c06b7a2635edc1c6a1254b763f499b81\nparent 07905b2fc810ec5697adf852e7f44ac0aff930c6\nparent 80e955c992fa77381397ff4c46ad31998b18c091\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791242294 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791242294 -0700\n\nfix: Turn on compression for portal pages and scripts (#1638)\n\nThe compression change in #1636 never took effect. The gateway accepted\nthe setting but silently skipped it, because each compression type needs\nits own settings block, even an empty one. Staging still sends every\npage and script uncompressed.\n\nThis adds the empty settings blocks.\n\nAfter it reaches staging:\n- [ ] Scripts arrive Brotli-compressed","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxDA2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdrwQAA48u5mkN