\n\nEnvoy Gateway v1.9.2 drops a compressor entry that has no settings\nblock, even an empty one, and still reports the policy as Accepted. So\nthe compressor added in #1636 never reached Envoy, and staging still\nsends every response uncompressed. Add empty brotli and gzip blocks.","tree":{"sha":"d84983d6c06b7a2635edc1c6a1254b763f499b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/d84983d6c06b7a2635edc1c6a1254b763f499b81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/80e955c992fa77381397ff4c46ad31998b18c091","verification":{"payload":"tree d84983d6c06b7a2635edc1c6a1254b763f499b81\nparent 07905b2fc810ec5697adf852e7f44ac0aff930c6\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791241998 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791241998 -0700\n\nfix: Turn on gateway compression for the portal\n\nEnvoy Gateway v1.9.2 drops a compressor entry that has no settings\nblock, even an empty one, and still reports the policy as Accepted. So\nthe compressor added in #1636 never reached Envoy, and staging still\nsends every response uncompressed. Add empty brotli and gzip blocks.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrELw4ACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j06xg//ZHJk+shOV6+e/9qIacxPH2hQ2WtbSaGsxsCxTRRS3oYA3Hrm/m7QXonO\n0QFcSj/e2Ej46brRXVV7aOMwSz2DLswxuncUMmrptl779rMOUNlN6Ad+Ws+hPz65\nS4Xw8HVRi3UAcf26aLTJcs37fg55pnPZFZccLq+qQf5Gi2agMteeFzyUvENfoqBc\nShAr62tz8G8QsuoVdkCsHj55txYXs7mSg8+hGHYsfgjhtlHUOtFznhmjsfOnOJR1\nNFxlWvhCCAOnn+1cPTwfToIiHQxK/bvcFF2IOvI4DhFKIMhg401Fw6jmYp8pJiYj\nokoNgtG0jsHriOnNb53S2c50zNHGHsvvavwt6vfx7Q33BZtGowzyOOYtNKE1Cyqy\nMKQe12dBFUc1M0eCrPXmn1M9jDwPisliNBB+mnnkwougFtBaiAuR74KI8Hh77iI1\nTPaLFCXii4Lew+27sQ1BXJuLy3jblZFOjhphuIZVbOrdYO5Gz9vQbNBL9P+yIUgG\nF5X8AaHqysaFR3ZENjCLNnjkQ1pZFXGcPPVQirRydCsQvsb2l44nsRSYPfX/fnrj\nYvvblhAlKGGumI39l/0AnGy+fW2tc5VkBTbf6p9ucpJWvn4xxAQFa25fd8L5cN5v\n3Uum5T4cR8j+Froyd29RGoGawDs3dRrJuDtuClWFohEtXDfTViU=\n=PSkb\n-----END PGP 