/api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/07905b2fc810ec5697adf852e7f44ac0aff930c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:59:02Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:59:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf: Compress portal pages and scripts before sending them (#1636)\n\nThe portal sends its pages, scripts and styles uncompressed, in\nproduction and staging. A first visit to the organization list downloads\nabout 4.4MB. The largest script alone is 1.8MB.\n\nThis turns on Brotli and Gzip at the gateway in front of the portal.\nCompressed, that largest script should be about a third of its current\nsize.\n\nLive updates and assistant chat replies stream as event streams, which\nthe gateway leaves uncompressed, so they keep streaming as they do\ntoday.\n\nAfter it reaches staging:\n- [ ] Scripts arrive Brotli-compressed\n- [ ] Live updates and assistant chat still stream\n- [ ] Pages still render progressively while data loads","tree":{"sha":"da02443a1b8df78cebc4737cb7619a61e68297be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/da02443a1b8df78cebc4737cb7619a61e68297be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/07905b2fc810ec5697adf852e7f44ac0aff930c6","verification":{"payload":"tree da02443a1b8df78cebc4737cb7619a61e68297be\nparent d733c4c0e430ff07715ba5c4f2540487386fdd63\nparent 3b1c97e0f6512a383a95bd4afcf37bc751fd8bc4\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791241142 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791241142 -0700\n\nperf: Compress portal pages and scripts before sending them (#1636)\n\nThe portal sends its pages, scripts and styles uncompressed, in\nproduction and staging. A first visit to the organization list downloads\nabout 4.4MB. The largest script alone is 1.8MB.\n\nThis turns on Brotli and Gzip at the gateway in front of the portal.\nCompressed, that largest script should be about a third of its current\nsize.\n\nLive updates and assistant chat replies stream as event streams, which\nthe gateway leaves uncompressed, so they keep streaming as they do\ntoday.\n\nAfter it reaches staging:\n- [ ] Scripts arrive Brotli-compressed\n- [ ] Live updates and assistant chat still stream\n- [ ] Pages still render progressively while data loads","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxCu2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWmQQAGiCM5eaED6j9Zke9fLIK7mN\nv8OI6WxVVjinC/nb/megOafy7BlE6cD9XvzT9OyOJf9hYL74DqpA9YSDbWKs+56l\ndlnWRDoZDOvxHkIq6wRibUvlo3cJjQVsJACp7ZriUKwzW8AKHcGnr8tTB5EB3VLJ\nenvSxUCpISolNUwIvYjGhfdKtPpHEj4DIQVHpCO1yYpKLvXvW/LtmP8+AN2kmCpj\nsCImC/n3Mou8e7jMbqHpilybNwAnED9nJSgC+xdcW/DPB6iD7W62H8CmEC3QIlkH\nsdnVxL6tvq6mmDkr+otdAG2ySw2EMD5vs2WR6yJA7HwvR8ORAzYF3u6XEnznQiN5\nSGYXh9DR55LSbAofM4xLrskgi8VCS3k9mt02xeJ1ECCc6ro9lBsyED7a/kGZZkGp\n+lve3x73P9+1UeaVk8bHSqRp0xYvk+vZvgutwS9Ip+L6twPBVk4ELqXaRgDIJWvP\nFDRxgEBKqmJrMSfMz1COuXdRI8n5pK1bVwjs61U248o08aCFiMN4n/hTf81pGh3/\nq0AhMt8yAe71xp1Y3Q4z8sJDX3mdrLdOGQFz7SgAGFsjDOb6UfOmCeJNZv+c0lup\nTnFuBea/7U9qwBgF8d3JSQSqj3GNiebnoaKphxT/GDpNpvmOBDRrODMW/x02S81y\nkylrioi7gwuoKO633GeY\n=EZ9V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:59:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse