lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/996e4c80e59c89dac16c59ff041f702f7399eace/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:05:33Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:05:33Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"perf: Load the note editor only when someone edits a note\n\nThe load balancer description and the note dialog both rendered the\ndatum-ui rich-text editor, which pulls in tiptap and prosemirror (about\n185KB gzipped), but only after a click. Move the shared editor into\nNoteEditor and load it through LazyNoteEditor, which shows a spinner\nwhile it arrives.\n\nThe pages that display notes still download the editor until they\nimport RichTextContent from the display-only entry added in\ndatum-cloud/datum-ui#233.","tree":{"sha":"a9335f22331b7e6936c33bda6f9494095e0b7212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/a9335f22331b7e6936c33bda6f9494095e0b7212"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/996e4c80e59c89dac16c59ff041f702f7399eace","verification":{"payload":"tree a9335f22331b7e6936c33bda6f9494095e0b7212\nparent d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791237933 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791237933 -0700\n\nperf: Load the note editor only when someone edits a note\n\nThe load balancer description and the note dialog both rendered the\ndatum-ui rich-text editor, which pulls in tiptap and prosemirror (about\n185KB gzipped), but only after a click. Move the shared editor into\nNoteEditor and load it through LazyNoteEditor, which shows a spinner\nwhile it arrives.\n\nThe pages that display notes still download the editor until they\nimport RichTextContent from the display-only entry added in\ndatum-cloud/datum-ui#233.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrEHzYACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j3+HxAAtbQGdAQgufTH2zIrgJFbSGcAf+ZoVi6u1k4ETejAEuxEN6d6GUDSo+aW\nyowcfuQdyqCdXXGBdk92DqkkfEk3MJuEevshXKrwH+gpPzdi7X0cHTsFlaCmlqZE\notvoVRbwuCvkb9jVzUlgZA/KxsGMte9zcKGPZAWJNVa6Ucs7H9EGESS4LDXIy+xT\nuoe+VUQYVPO4GroZyKf/MJ++vnSqISr5VKQ1Mf8bRqg1y0WXy003ADoKJhaFat/L\nnw0jmQil8iPoWmt5zaFb4Cf4bFk6YhoeqDUpMS0+YPv1/IxkUv6IqZ+IdU9/fcTA\n0YVfofc9ydyZk+H5N/73iYDpkZSspAq1bPca2/RGx7hMMAT8qVpz19Cd+cdeLiIE\n9YykOcbgBXOII8mzpoutNgUQors6YMARRRHGUD9RkAlcShP4IDnJWbIWdsqOAnIJ\nhlrt+NgFtgCxU431bVaLqqjc/HBFG9of8vgmwm515jxeVVCVAx5686cOwTSWYLfm\nG/fwjtikn7A1e01GveueWzcnFPsFvjrfVmtoM+16iDA/9W8v4AXmnMc84kKcouON\nFUiqZUT+lIljGwJdfX/ZjVv6TTUJ3KAXNEd5Wm7PsieAchTyw6BORtCMJcAsoy59\nCCMySM0uU9XOcRcPu0QGfb87yZhpV5XFGkPaA30a33xJ1KWWapk=\n=wDPy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:06:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/996e4c80e59c89dac16c59ff041f702f7399eace","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDk5NmU0YzgwZTU5Yzg5ZGFjMTZjNTlmZjA0MWY3MDJmNzM5OWVhY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f","sha":"d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f"}],"sha":"996e4c80e59c89dac16c59ff041f702f7399eace","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/996e4c80e59c89dac16c59ff041f702f7399eace"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:55:23Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:55:23Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"perf: Defer Stripe and Help Scout until the page is idle or in use\n\nStripe''s main package entry injects Stripe.js as soon as it''s imported,\nso any page that imported a billing form, like the organization list,\ndownloaded 264KB of Stripe during first load. Payment forms now use the\npure entry, and every page loads Stripe.js once the browser is idle, so\nRadar still sees the whole session without slowing first load.\n\nThe Help Scout Beacon is only opened from the header and support links,\nbut its 170KB script loaded on every page. It now loads on the first\nopen, toggle or support message, queueing init, config and identify\nahead of the requested action through Help Scout''s ready queue.","tree":{"sha":"5179ab3963419e19db953513b03680543117cf7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/5179ab3963419e19db953513b03680543117cf7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5179ab3963419e19db953513b03680543117cf7e\nparent 97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791237323 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791237323 -0700\n\nperf: Defer Stripe and Help Scout until the page is idle or in use\n\nStripe''s main package entry injects Stripe.js as soon as it''s imported,\nso any page that imported a billing form, like the organization list,\ndownloaded 264KB of Stripe during first load. Payment forms now use the\npure entry, and every page loads Stripe.js once the browser is idle, so\nRadar still sees the whole session without slowing first load.\n\nThe Help Scout Beacon is only opened from the header and support links,\nbut its 170KB script loaded on every page. It now loads on the first\nopen, toggle or support message, queueing init, config and identify\nahead of the requested action through Help Scout''s ready queue.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrEHNcACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j36Kg//U2U7aVjkTWo3yQTa6hPzVYrMB2EWit5oEMMHJWqbXaoC0TDom9jD5bDG\natIA1xdM+JRrbOgNj4CiR2ibOID41Eb4leL7aenutSS0r1io3Ng5A/fqi8IWOPhf\niZtTSRNSL92h/V4W6FfTBrg4GV5IM60cI5QLk9q2WekXtpeMM9gxZH9O+vexJcpn\nNndYyuGmt0PUrE1rbPyFTAOs9jDjcsDgcvIb8pyVp5Sf3bZYixGOFtC10wMe2/qG\nCRwxazKBTKeSkxKuUcFe0KQvec2/vsD3KQ5HLdGvOwhCND6YVIwO+DltpfjS4sLQ\nRliNYq/DuFuOrolIsbxeCB+Tqdaoa6c7adP6pM0PYy4ClUtS0x37wBZ4XlMYbAQD\niIEADWc/IEh1WHoi/rGH5Ohz3/obZoae9gseKGOVWdFw8DLrrLf2QQ8Gt6ZAGCV3\na15HF764wLuiifzJ3Yftls4FovGV9M6+aGR5SdSCtPIzPBtv+7LPOXH3uDF0MfIy\nAu8XqQmrs/q0EME8k1wI6xmpPad/Ly27Zah6xrXdtAWimLg6wK9xXwyEX2U3qsce\nge6id9uGXD0pX3z/vSbJyFbNCIYJ80X9ytozqYaaopBVMOHNB3jZgGo4BmPt3W4O\nvf+KYql5db4KlfLEXYVS6cs7fQVZuOFaROR7WaiaNPQ7gZTiehQ=\n=2SNo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:06:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKGQ0NGQzNmQzNWYxNzBkNzk2MjczMzZiNDM2OWIxNDYyNDY1YzlmMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817","sha":"97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817"}],"sha":"d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/d44d36d35f170d79627336b4369b1462465c9f1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:45:26Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:45:26Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"perf: Stop every page from loading its stylesheet twice\n\nThe Docker build left out .gitignore, which Tailwind reads to decide what\nto scan. The server build runs after the client build, so it scanned the\nclient''s minified JS in build/ and picked up junk classes. The server\nstylesheet came out about 1KB larger with a different hash, so the HTML\nlinked one stylesheet and the client linked another, and every cold load\ndownloaded about 300KB of CSS twice.\n\nExclude build/ from Tailwind''s scan, and keep .gitignore in the Docker\nbuild so it scans the same files a local build does.","tree":{"sha":"fb9b43651eb1e49715ffc829df93b808671a6588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/fb9b43651eb1e49715ffc829df93b808671a6588"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817","verification":{"payload":"tree fb9b43651eb1e49715ffc829df93b808671a6588\nparent 524eb1046dec688231b66ce8261c25fe2bf9d75b\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791236726 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791236726 -0700\n\nperf: Stop every page from loading its stylesheet twice\n\nThe Docker build left out .gitignore, which Tailwind reads to decide what\nto scan. The server build runs after the client build, so it scanned the\nclient''s minified JS in build/ and picked up junk classes. The server\nstylesheet came out about 1KB larger with a different hash, so the HTML\nlinked one stylesheet and the client linked another, and every cold load\ndownloaded about 300KB of CSS twice.\n\nExclude build/ from Tailwind''s scan, and keep .gitignore in the Docker\nbuild so it scans the same files a local build does.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrEGnYACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j3s1g/7BjG6h2JMY3aw4ly2mOU8z2n9mxhVbc1gpk552I+uvHY7zFJ6ekY+2wrs\nVbbwIm7csSx3y9zQOgt0cEPcGoykae87Qy+PcqRG7Z1E8ZZCNi5Vy/XYhVSP7i+F\ncET+DILZQfYNXY4Uzkezu7PNORseePynq4ZGIOpD5Xo4vvajp0BkplxYfFT5gH28\nWAu2CiLNe81RCmHOyIIbh5w0R6algaG8wTOZ0WcmmcO4PZp1Qms4fsiKpv5N7bti\njWaWCSfC13Q8k8fd1xAMKqIsQPuXTyVdUOPV9VrezNj86zygDOicV+5LYf+i/oDy\nhr2ilsIYJNHPcUAug+zUNPqdY9s79SzfXZj/5J+ibXrwacfzdVXHirCGGk5TG49w\nTqDjzDCK0ZmhUNBwYsqT/rYCYwLOZ42gn6JuZXTbEjaXNYJGXc1A/pxzIV4jaAED\n2yDGEhjTn5XrGVUv0ofxE4P0oDghNvUeXs9UCQz0TfnnU9crNQOyJsLA8/t4KDLs\njxRvGVFflIg2rTUxDTHw9eI0HZIK6EMssVvu7W+7MBtA1+BDK1tvpn5P9pIoAn3/\nU9yHpM+ME+w9BPWM09akTaEsvzhDtzbo4XYhIKSuJhmn9Ew+Rr1sZzMlXLIT6vMq\n0vqGHk1aJ2E2yPtb7y9IBp3Hu96MlzH8LQAz/j6d62ftwxNgtxQ=\n=xyU8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:06:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDk3ODA3YzdlYTYzMDU3MjZiYTU0MjI2ODdlYTE4MjU0NGMyZjU4MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/524eb1046dec688231b66ce8261c25fe2bf9d75b","sha":"524eb1046dec688231b66ce8261c25fe2bf9d75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/524eb1046dec688231b66ce8261c25fe2bf9d75b"}],"sha":"97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/97807c7ea6305726ba5422687ea182544c2f5817"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/524eb1046dec688231b66ce8261c25fe2bf9d75b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:39:42Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:39:42Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"perf: Load less JavaScript on the first visit to each page\n\nThe vendor chunk groups for datum-ui, recharts, lucide and streamdown\nalso pulled in every package those depend on. Because the root route\nimports datum-ui, every page loaded tiptap, recharts, zod and js-yaml up\nfront. Keep only the React group. Gzipped JS before first render drops\nfrom 971K to 382K on login and from 1096K to 771K at the median route.\n\nAlso drop the Canela font preload. It pointed at /fonts/, while the CSS\nloads the hashed copy from /assets/, so every cold load fetched the\n284KB font twice.","tree":{"sha":"2a321320de0aff01f63871d21869d4da64b198a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/2a321320de0aff01f63871d21869d4da64b198a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/524eb1046dec688231b66ce8261c25fe2bf9d75b","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a321320de0aff01f63871d21869d4da64b198a2\nparent d733c4c0e430ff07715ba5c4f2540487386fdd63\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791236382 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791236382 -0700\n\nperf: Load less JavaScript on the first visit to each page\n\nThe vendor chunk groups for datum-ui, recharts, lucide and streamdown\nalso pulled in every package those depend on. Because the root route\nimports datum-ui, every page loaded tiptap, recharts, zod and js-yaml up\nfront. Keep only the React group. Gzipped JS before first render drops\nfrom 971K to 382K on login and from 1096K to 771K at the median route.\n\nAlso drop the Canela font preload. It pointed at /fonts/, while the CSS\nloads the hashed copy from /assets/, so every cold load fetched the\n284KB font twice.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrEGSYACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j2OwhAAwEBzVSrJ2+jx9pKRQ4fk7SNikIVHoDPOxH1YGx9rTi2WnrlbXpwSoFrQ\nuBsDzIyKuVsib6DUZV/y4zJDMpa9UF0tGtjGFpCOtsfwDnRQ1k+msq4BSILSbWpE\n3Az2KGAA4rpRS4wJ3Yfg2MV3gsFRiGBCNH6ppQOh7bqrgpunWMJXfaFqrVe+dvd1\nTwKLwouse1zPCWrSXFoXKpbaADqbUzm97wnnyFXz7DvhRnJ0ugo2lKmgo9OSOOYV\n2lErvavS3bPUrV5J6Ieg