eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/1323cd41aecd0e04b9c89747fd61aabbfbd85765/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:57:22Z","email":"mc@datum.net","name":"Michael Costello"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:57:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Show ALB logs only to people who can query them (#1628)\n\n## Summary\n\nPeople on custom roles could see the load balancer logs panel and then\nhit a permission error on every query, while others with real access had\nit hidden.\n\nSince Milo began checking subresource permissions, a log query passes\ntwo checks that the panel''s permission check never asked about.\n\nThe panel now shows only when both checks pass, which needed permission\nchecks in the portal to carry a subresource through to Milo.\n\nThe Cypress component and end-to-end suites were not run.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Lint, typecheck, formatting and the unit suite pass, and the new\ntests fail against the previous code\n- [ ] A user whose role cannot run a log query does not see the panel\n- [ ] A user on a built-in viewer role sees the panel and gets log\nresults\n\nFixes #1627","tree":{"sha":"529ab67bdca8954ad71d2345540f2688caf1cde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/529ab67bdca8954ad71d2345540f2688caf1cde8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/1323cd41aecd0e04b9c89747fd61aabbfbd85765","verification":{"payload":"tree 529ab67bdca8954ad71d2345540f2688caf1cde8\nparent 5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2\nparent 3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af\nauthor Michael Costello <mc@datum.net> 1791154642 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791154642 -0400\n\nfix: Show ALB logs only to people who can query them (#1628)\n\n## Summary\n\nPeople on custom roles could see the load balancer logs panel and then\nhit a permission error on every query, while others with real access had\nit hidden.\n\nSince Milo began checking subresource permissions, a log query passes\ntwo checks that the panel''s permission check never asked about.\n\nThe panel now shows only when both checks pass, which needed permission\nchecks in the portal to carry a subresource through to Milo.\n\nThe Cypress component and end-to-end suites were not run.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Lint, typecheck, formatting and the unit suite pass, and the new\ntests fail against the previous code\n- [ ] A user whose role cannot run a log query does not see the panel\n- [ ] A user on a built-in viewer role sees the panel and gets log\nresults\n\nFixes #1627","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwtnSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf/sQABNHWfJjOQw+4QpzhLvgL+28\nosA03wT8SxQHv2kd6OBQJsWPOBpB4uMlI1x9vyJzAlD5LH0XE3gUjwdOGwv5Wnzl\nKWX8DcMZbYze0fOuxc6kS+Ftgk6wsN4mZ4Kk55cdIqdiZVLERzQu3aRxr+t2xXeU\nC8dVYOggEsKMPBxOW4iIQSoQDBTNWHSiqgcA2lDSugKTUsKqIKcYZfFy5mVIp8bE\nWvDMEOFALCtzgLiG7IgBB+aZCUtrlEOB8etOkESBYHxM36EfXQ1dK8XxKCmh88w1\nSDbpkaPJMTvfLejLqiXk+qBjOPP1PFHMxG3IOYdBGWDheywl1YjaRMfP9D7MQmyV\nnBeup5LHEmfLN6lvd1M6mYIlSLA6J44Cl+w1fQrILH0wk8LJIu4lxVADHxy2j2+f\nPADn/5RmCJCYq43pSNpgb/3rByvqoPsbEnDgXekzb83BuXmaawmyH303jYwg4gmC\nRAKDdZj/Bm/x0w56YQHuAa9LL/HEUP9E2TOvM5Ai2JaRJm6AF4orUtuQAj80V7Qg\n2RvtZdMEQRWyW2U+yW4Pw49xGDRMWAx3a1+s4r6yMF0Fxq3QAPB6NWX9eCBwh0dh\nPiDX10wIFJEyM7ZED660V0xcci8PoRWTKTOlF0IEZhVsfGQFmC5ivpUbX2bdBAA3\nlzSa4vD1TTo1GhMdWp8j\n=9ETv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T22:57:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/1323cd41aecd0e04b9c89747fd61aabbfbd85765","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDEzMjNjZDQxYWVjZDBlMDRiOWM4OTc0N2ZkNjFhYWJiZmJkODU3NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2","sha":"5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af","sha":"3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af"}],"sha":"1323cd41aecd0e04b9c89747fd61aabbfbd85765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/1323cd41aecd0e04b9c89747fd61aabbfbd85765"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5209578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xmc","id":5209578,"login":"0xmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDk1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:10Z","email":"mc@datum.net","name":"Michael Costello"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:10Z","email":"mc@datum.net","name":"Michael Costello"},"message":"fix: Gate ALB logs on the checks a query passes\n\nThe ALB logs panel was gated on o11y.miloapis.com/logs.get. With Milo''s\nsubresource authorization on, a log query is reviewed twice instead: the\naggregator hop reads /logs/loki/api/v1/... as resource logs, name loki,\nsubresource api (logs/api.get), and queryapi then reviews its own route as\nlogs.query with no name, subresource or namespace. A custom role holding only\nlogs.get saw the panel and got a 403 on every query, and a role holding the\nnew permissions was hidden.\n\nThe portal''s permission checks could not express a subresource: the BFF\nschema stripped unknown fields, so the field never reached Milo.\n\nKey changes:\n- thread an optional subresource from usePermission through the BFF schema,\n  RbacService and the SelfSubjectAccessReview payload, and include it in the\n  query cache key and the bulk dedupe identity\n- accept queryapi''s query verb in permission checks\n- gate the panel on both reviews: logs/api.get with name loki, and\n  logs.query, each with an empty namespace at project scope\n\nThe provider resolves logs/api.get with name loki against the Logs:loki\ninstance plus the project, kind root and scope root, so including the name\nalso honors an instance-level binding, as the real request does.\n\nThe new tests fail against the previous code (12 failures) and pass with\nthis change.\n\nFixes #1627","tree":{"sha":"529ab67bdca8954ad71d2345540f2688caf1cde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/529ab67bdca8954ad71d2345540f2688caf1cde8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5209578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xmc","id":5209578,"login":"0xmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDk1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDNjNzE1ZDNmNTU2NGQ0ODcwYjJmOTUwYWYwMDg0NTVkYWQ5ZWU2YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2","sha":"5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2"}],"sha":"3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/3c715d3f5564d4870b2f950af008455dad9ee6af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:47:09Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:47:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Edit multiple ALB backends and tighten the overview layout (#1617)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe portal could show only one ALB backend, and any routing edit rewrote\nthe rule with just the first backend, silently dropping the rest.\n\nUsers can now edit every backend in one dialog, with URLs and\nNetworkServices side by side, weights, a load-balancing algorithm, and\npassive health checks. Routing the portal cannot save back intact is\nlocked with a note to use datumctl.\n\nThe overview also moves to a two-column layout with the default hostname\nfirst, and page padding is tighter across the app.\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"957\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c21b1c16-35b9-4bf1-aa70-29b6e322c0ec\"\n/>\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bda18d2a-075a-4b19-a21c-f5fd4a970575\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af580580-1c0c-4c21-a4d2-1dea2da63c86\n\n\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Add a URL and a NetworkService backend with weights, save, and see\nthe traffic split on the backend card\n- [ ] Switch a consistent-hash ALB to round robin and save without an\nAPI error\n- [ ] Toggle HSTS or force HTTPS on a multi-backend ALB and every\nbackend is still there\n- [ ] Unit tests, lint, and typecheck pass\n\nRelated to datum-cloud/enhancements#744\nRelated to datum-cloud/enhancements#291","tree":{"sha":"871e7971dad8be54d54c9c585f7824695a11f2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/871e7971dad8be54d54c9c585f7824695a11f2fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/5bf55b51a424209d2eaddeed9670f7eda13973a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 871e7971dad8be54d54c9c585f7824695a11f2fb\nparent 4de2258bdaa42bbb5e6da64018e7569890ffa24b\nparent 1bd95797647833f273b81e2ef80acd772fe831c0\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791046029 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791046029 -0700\n\nfeat: Edit multiple ALB backends and tighten the overview layout (#1617)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe portal could show only one ALB backend, and any routing edit rewrote\nthe rule with just the first backend, silently dropping the rest.\n\nUsers can now edit every backend in one dialog, with URLs and\nNetworkServices side by side, weights, a load-balancing algorithm, and\npassive health checks. Routing the portal cannot save back intact is\nlocked with a note to use datumctl.\n\nThe overview also moves to a two-column layout with the default hostname\nfirst, and page padding is tighter across the app.\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"957\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c21b1c16-35b9-4bf1-aa70-29b6e322c0ec\"\n/>\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bda18d2a-075a-4b19-a21c-f5fd4a970575\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af580580-1c0c-4c21-a4d2-1dea2da63c86\n\n\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Add a URL and a NetworkService backend with weights, save, and see\nthe traffic split on the backend card\n- [ ] Switch a consistent-hash ALB to round robin and save without an\nAPI error\n- [ ] Toggle HSTS or force HTTPS on a multi-backend ALB and every\nbackend is still there\n- [ ] Unit tests, lint, and typecheck pass\n\nRelated to datum-cloud/enhancements#744\nRelated to datum-cloud/enhancements#291","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwTGNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQbQQACJZi2rCnJ3huBQwd+JtBGGr\nI1hpg8gajK9Y3Yhi/Fgai8/RADmp4f2qIzSY557mtxYOenZB/YzeSqB/6FxhMnds\nmcYLwkcWsOKpjnUwpGVSqZ9ksJHZ1i2mWnXAFea4uB4iLACydu9Yn4YshdY9xqNX\nNbnV1T+tsHJRywzqere2Od+uZmnHC/kexs8Pc/extUu9+XEppfrOimYhMKQ2bmLs\nVMHhn6U+mJ5dloBgZt8bZYuQInKvW/MHHxeE5LFBEbeAM1/ATuiO1Yf/ldk2TCEh\nRn1QplV2yITt5Tck3Clc9du/m3aEh7pwu7tf9mlSobrq/x6Ud8rFq6SJOJT1z3qm\nVSK2pb+sk3T1cb1igoaoBYAOXAQlvf/rMEz5sKeugt/GIUTYakII5KXJG0OF/cYA\nV/wbbwJwF3ghIX69/uwYwK674Wq44L74YHSRWO5x6kZyuQln70AVl07oM09XyGF8\ncM1JEwOgl8rNOV//8lbfdAtiiZqpkUKYKKty29OtU3mfRu0VQ3VOb0oxMXjL0yxU\nN5hHbLnKtlJxPoRc1btsqfUVHd5U8ybjambrpVv+ovP+pPbU8wboz929YB7Gve3R\nMr+E8rxJw0fZyAXzgKa5g7JhqXjl2KLyFR2pJ2lOcTM9ZaWKRBnE6CM6e6Sh+KWY\neqPbjyeRBgzpUoid9apC\n=WAwB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T16:47:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: