_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/10296a6e7cc675e99594dd3264425115d9716ac3","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDEwMjk2YTZlN2NjNjc1ZTk5NTk0ZGQzMjY0NDI1MTE1ZDk3MTZhYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/5158e8faf6f11f4908536ffb860da92ccb8b45ac","sha":"5158e8faf6f11f4908536ffb860da92ccb8b45ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/5158e8faf6f11f4908536ffb860da92ccb8b45ac"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/4de2258bdaa42bbb5e6da64018e7569890ffa24b","sha":"4de2258bdaa42bbb5e6da64018e7569890ffa24b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/4de2258bdaa42bbb5e6da64018e7569890ffa24b"}],"sha":"10296a6e7cc675e99594dd3264425115d9716ac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/10296a6e7cc675e99594dd3264425115d9716ac3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7876213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gaghan430","id":7876213,"login":"gaghan430","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NzYyMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaghan430","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/4de2258bdaa42bbb5e6da64018e7569890ffa24b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:26:29Z","email":"gaghan430@gmail.com","name":"Dodik Gaghan S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:26:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(graphql): name all gateway operations via runGqlQuery/runGqlMutation (#1590) (#1618)\n\n## What\n\nNames all 8 genql operations so the gateway stops grouping them under\n`Anonymous` and slow-query traces can name the feature. Closes #1590.\n\nRather than add `__name` to each call + a lint rule, this introduces two\ntiny helpers so **naming is guaranteed by construction** (the issue''s \"a\nwrapper\" option):\n\n- `runGqlQuery(name, request, scope)` / `runGqlMutation(name, request,\nscope)` in `modules/graphql/client.ts` — `name` is a required argument,\nso an op can''t go out unnamed. They also wrap `createGqlClient` +\n`generateQueryOp`/`generateMutationOp` + `client.query`/`mutation` +\n`mapApiError`, and return the result typed from the selection\n(`FieldsSelection`) instead of `any`.\n\n## The 8 operations named\n\n| op | file |\n|---|---|\n| `OrganizationMembershipList` | `organization.gateway.ts` (listAll) |\n| `OrganizationMemberships`, `Organization`, `OrganizationCreate`,\n`OrganizationUpdate`, `OrganizationDelete` |\n`organization.gql-service.ts` |\n| `UserSessions`, `DeleteSession` | `user.gql-service.ts` |\n\n(The hand-written `OrganizationMembersBatch` string query was already\nnamed — unchanged.)\n\n## Guard\n\nA `no-restricted-imports` rule (`eslint.config.mjs`) blocks\n`generateQueryOp`/`generateMutationOp` outside `client.ts`, so new ops\nmust go through the named helpers — they can''t end up back under\n`Anonymous`.\n\n## Scope\n\nSmall and surgical — no ops-layer restructure (cloud-portal''s gql\nalready lives in tidy `*.gql-service.ts` files). 5 files, one commit.\nEach call site also loses its boilerplate and its `as …` result cast\nwhere the typed result flows cleanly (transform-boundary casts into the\nk8s adapters are kept, behavior unchanged).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `tsc --noEmit` → 0 errors\n- `eslint --fix` → 0 errors; guard confirmed firing on a probe\n- UI paths that exercise the live ops: `/account/organizations` + org\nswitcher (`OrganizationMembershipList`),\n`/account/settings/active-sessions` (`UserSessions` + `DeleteSession`)\n\n## Note\n\nThe other 5 ops\n(`OrganizationMemberships`/`Organization`/create/update/delete) are\nwired through services/hooks but not reached by any current screen —\n`gql-service.list`/`get` in particular look superseded by the gateway\n`listAll`. Naming them is still correct for when they run; the dead-path\ncleanup is out of scope here.","tree":{"sha":"d27f8a4ed4cc998f126ecf413d90e31cd6a8f375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/d27f8a4ed4cc998f126ecf413d90e31cd6a8f375"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/4de2258bdaa42bbb5e6da64018e7569890ffa24b","verification":{"payload":"tree d27f8a4ed4cc998f126ecf413d90e31cd6a8f375\nparent c4cdf67e0b4d40ed009b0c7eb03a0e80560995ae\nparent 1853fbdc9e10229c244ba2491cfc53b186ede595\nauthor Dodik Gaghan S <gaghan430@gmail.com> 1790915189 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790915189 +0700\n\nfix(graphql): name all gateway operations via runGqlQuery/runGqlMutation (#1590) (#1618)\n\n## What\n\nNames all 8 genql operations so the gateway stops grouping them under\n`Anonymous` and slow-query traces can name the feature. Closes #1590.\n\nRather than add `__name` to each call + a lint rule, this introduces two\ntiny helpers so **naming is guaranteed by construction** (the issue''s \"a\nwrapper\" option):\n\n- `runGqlQuery(name, request, scope)` / `runGqlMutation(name, request,\nscope)` in `modules/graphql/client.ts` — `name` is a required argument,\nso an op can''t go out unnamed. They also wrap `createGqlClient` +\n`generateQueryOp`/`generateMutationOp` + `client.query`/`mutation` +\n`mapApiError`, and return the result typed from the selection\n(`FieldsSelection`) instead of `any`.\n\n## The 8 operations named\n\n| op | file |\n|---|---|\n| `OrganizationMembershipList` | `organization.gateway.ts` (listAll) |\n| `OrganizationMemberships`, `Organization`, `OrganizationCreate`,\n`OrganizationUpdate`, `OrganizationDelete` |\n`organization.gql-service.ts` |\n| `UserSessions`, `DeleteSession` | `user.gql-service.ts` |\n\n(The hand-written `OrganizationMembersBatch` string query was already\nnamed — unchanged.)\n\n## Guard\n\nA `no-restricted-imports` rule (`eslint.config.mjs`) blocks\n`generateQueryOp`/`generateMutationOp` outside `client.ts`, so new ops\nmust go through the named helpers — they can''t end up back under\n`Anonymous`.\n\n## Scope\n\nSmall and surgical — no ops-layer restructure (cloud-portal''s gql\nalready lives in tidy `*.gql-service.ts` files). 5 files, one commit.\nEach call site also loses its boilerplate and its `as …` result cast\nwhere the typed result flows cleanly (transform-boundary casts into the\nk8s adapters are kept, behavior unchanged).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `tsc --noEmit` → 0 errors\n- `eslint --fix` → 0 errors; guard confirmed firing on a probe\n- UI paths that exercise the live ops: `/account/organizations` + org\nswitcher (`OrganizationMembershipList`),\n`/account/settings/active-sessions` (`UserSessions` + `DeleteSession`)\n\n## Note\n\nThe other 5 ops\n(`OrganizationMemberships`/`Organization`/create/update/delete) are\nwired through services/hooks but not reached by any current screen —\n`gql-service.list`/`get` in particular look superseded by the gateway\n`listAll`. Naming them is still correct for when they run; the dead-path\ncleanup is out of scope here.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvzJ1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvaIQAKkV/JRFerDRo8Xl53d8vNDD\npakSdd0oaLIe52C0k2Bwvn/cSn7syQbqGDbifBMFUiHgYfK4ZK1XCjI5aG7K8cKF\nV1sEzs2dgF9Qn7jV5hb6w85uuwXMsNwNae5PpCz8qQnwXaozAp7ieUiL0TjiGMxc\n3yHK+O+5xPQDri36Ow6eOAw5Esyqe/ULsHWoheNvjBuGebOMH3ERvDIKjkMtiMw0\ndYnPJr0kEJE2GSIceRDeOylNACAziu13JT9jvRa87cmbeu21Bk4ISwgPywUfE4OS\nmR2GXEUpwtM8bC7o5ewMGhtYSA2sdeo/toBRAXfNe5wdAMZJEsD6ToOh29VEDEIs\n/VuNXf/rynQ36eiVX7nlr+lLG37fDVoNnxuqGWorRLSW86yNXNJCbHQmccgIxS1w\n0l6B5n4vvlyvwpVBzC05FpJjoWTlgPp1CqFFDQXKz9DRzoWmRgKYfQAEhP9qASYU\nQNgbtNBftX1oA0FsYbRSnHDddHTBo1dGbpBUUnvT5D+G+8hsb4KWHWSgmXBrkQRE\nFEsvdDZgYkMVTR3ILJ02kqtsCYOrd3/aFHeUB2qljI8BhbG1LseHCOQBuO9W6TqC\nJol3V3ohnLTmTBNFSUTszTYqKTDkVr/2e1bX8RJAcNZjeMk7ODtcGjx5MUwZwdJY\nVKLoTn1WIsNAHQA65LhS\n=7M/q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T04:26:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users