tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/c4cdf67e0b4d40ed009b0c7eb03a0e80560995ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:12:08Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:12:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Show load balancers and the activity digest on the project home page (#1615)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe project home page had no view of a project''s load balancers, and its\nactivity list was a plain five-row column that cut long entries short.\n\nThe top row is now Domains, Workloads and a new ALB column, which lists\nthe newest load balancers and badges only the unhealthy ones.\n\nActivity moves to its own full-width row below Traffic and uses the same\nday-grouped digest as the project Activity page, showing changes people\nmade, without the filter bar.\n\n<img width=\"1268\" height=\"897\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b191cf7-87db-4091-998d-33b75719e6a0\"\n/>\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a056f3d5-e83e-4244-a54b-89b7923a39d3\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] The ALB column lists load balancers with links to each, and \"Add\nALB\" opens the create dialog only for users who can create one\n- [ ] A project with no load balancers shows the deploy prompt in the\nALB column\n- [ ] The home Activity row groups changes by day, collapses repeats,\nloads more on request, and leaves the page URL unchanged\n- [ ] Unit tests, typecheck, and lint pass","tree":{"sha":"118c5215d6f475f5d7dbee70079339e9dfd24c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/118c5215d6f475f5d7dbee70079339e9dfd24c8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/c4cdf67e0b4d40ed009b0c7eb03a0e80560995ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 118c5215d6f475f5d7dbee70079339e9dfd24c8c\nparent b9097b248b7bfeb8465a1e35f42c9d6a7eda4283\nparent 1ae75ec44967aac5691db91b16d1b643064892a7\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1790892728 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790892728 -0700\n\nfeat: Show load balancers and the activity digest on the project home page (#1615)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe project home page had no view of a project''s load balancers, and its\nactivity list was a plain five-row column that cut long entries short.\n\nThe top row is now Domains, Workloads and a new ALB column, which lists\nthe newest load balancers and badges only the unhealthy ones.\n\nActivity moves to its own full-width row below Traffic and uses the same\nday-grouped digest as the project Activity page, showing changes people\nmade, without the filter bar.\n\n<img width=\"1268\" height=\"897\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b191cf7-87db-4091-998d-33b75719e6a0\"\n/>\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a056f3d5-e83e-4244-a54b-89b7923a39d3\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] The ALB column lists load balancers with links to each, and \"Add\nALB\" opens the create dialog only for u