s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/5a0211db7e6c11742c12a5e5029a3d753e084617/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:26:54Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:26:54Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"chore(deps): upgrade @datum-cloud/datum-ui to 3.4\n\nThe portal moves from 3.2 to 3.4. The tiptap and js-yaml ranges rise to\nthe new peer floors from datum-ui 3.3 (>=3.30.5 and >=5.4.1); the\nlockfile already resolved patched versions, so only the ranges change.\n\nThe sample plugin moves from 1.x to 3.4, matching the portal''s major so\nits types match the components the host serves at runtime. It uses only\nBadge, Button, Card, Separator and Skeleton, so the 2.0 and 3.0 breaking\nchanges need no source edits. Its README now describes the shared\nsingletons the host actually provides, including the datum-ui subpaths.","tree":{"sha":"9142b56c3533162535525a59081aac61b55a62ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/9142b56c3533162535525a59081aac61b55a62ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/5a0211db7e