ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/2b422e2e657fc3b5582778cf3fcef74ab9461942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:21:36Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:21:36Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"feat(plugins): Let dock widgets render their own close button\n\nThe dock panel overlaid its close button on the panel''s top-right corner,\non top of whatever the widget put there. Patch''s chat header has its own\ncontrols in that corner, so the two collided.\n\nEvery `portal.dock/project` component is now mounted with an `onClose`\nprop. A widget that declares `handlesClose: true` in its manifest renders\nits own close control, so the panel drops its overlay one. Widgets that\ndon''t set the flag keep the overlay, so this is backwards compatible.\n\nThe lazy-load skeleton now mirrors the chat''s vertical layout (top bar\nand empty state) rather than the old left rail.","tree":{"sha":"af7ad87bfef6ed7d7ce86e9923cb2296d4c67a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/af7ad87bfef6ed7d7ce86e9923cb2296d4c67a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/2b422e2e657fc3b5582778cf3fcef74ab9461942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/2b422e2e657fc3b5582778cf3fcef74ab9461942","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKDJiNDIyZTJlNjU3ZmMzYjU1ODI3NzhjZjNmY2VmNzRhYjk0NjE5NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/6ebcd09a542c87420c865e285c5ba897b0e52642","sha":"6ebcd09a542c87420c865e285c5ba897b0e52642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/6ebcd09a542c87420c865e285c5ba897b0e52642"}],"sha":"2b422e2e657fc3b5582778cf3fcef74ab9461942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/2b422e2e657fc3b5582778cf3fcef74ab9461942"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/4b51c3170dfc975ce3a1de650f555400c6e6275a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:19:06Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:19:06Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"feat(alb): Unlock the backend pool on workload load balancers\n\nCompute deploys now keep an HTTPProxy''s configuration and only repoint\nthe workload''s own backend (datum-cloud/compute#395), so the Backends\ntab no longer needs to be read-only for them.\n\nThe pool, weights and algorithm are editable. The workload''s own\nbackend keeps its target locked, since each deploy resets it, and\ncan''t be removed, since each deploy adds it back; its weight can still\nchange. The overview describes a multi-backend workload ALB as a pool.","tree":{"sha":"eaa4417b8d25e83f5b2c770065aff690810dfd0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repo