rs only those columns used.\n- Columns drop their card border and header divider and render as open\n  sections again. The count, Add action and fixed-height bodies stay.\n\nThe health bar and traffic tiles are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"1f18bc0c7bbffa6c4db4fd6c1c815ce9ee683663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/1f18bc0c7bbffa6c4db4fd6c1c815ce9ee683663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/f613dcf5382db92911804e7dd9b7a5f941bc7709","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f18bc0c7bbffa6c4db4fd6c1c815ce9ee683663\nparent bda46a1f3e36e270a159582915caf3ad2d980ffd\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1790786521 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1790786521 -0700\n\nrefactor(project): Trim the home page back to one row of columns\n\nThe home page had grown into a dashboard of boxed cards. Pare it back:\n\n- Workloads returns to the middle of the first row, from the compute\n  plugin''s column or the placeholder, in place of DNS zones.\n- The second row (load balancers, usage and quotas) is gone, along with\n  the helpers only those columns used.\n- Columns drop their card border and header divider and render as open\n  sections again. The count, Add action and fixed-height bodies stay.\n\nThe health bar and traffic tiles are unchanged.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmq9O+EACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j13IRAApvUxN2WkM5uFDAwCa/trSvNQE90XpDptR6nfsIC7Dwh9OY7XdNE9hCwX\n1CMdIGpWKLg2zhdcuqwjiNMuykZm+4SfDmmlKa5kvv8ZjlIbnyzulr1ThXrHFt+r\n1A322c74eDCGOoZ/niYRUhJPuStmD0MWE++PgcJPP/t+f86FGIdi2z+PyeLi3NJA\npWuR/6b8P+t5MvAJ5gL6edBD/eW5TrWwIAMKt+2egcUC/APaEaPHrBysCv9217fU\nmV3o9mv+X1DHww5JzfUdN/69lTclnkKXbxhCEU4hhtLIPIDdpSsriigIpvwBv6/F\nWymysikkYDOjtcwHJQnO4A814aHVnY3iZRYvF0QYmELAFSJKH5q3L56poMKgtUz1\n6+2uvq0w/hJ6d2rjtUrWQ8Kyy1pNulcJOY+ba0zQeGiKHI8P/LMs8nNKNoPY247j\nkmrqEMEqiy9KIhbWe6EYffMRcmHZeF/7D1UJfbpnEQD0KNpfCTKg/ymoZZrGtyGZ\nmoYh0ZogR8+5L0jukHMDoV0wQ0dWqCHas1HObevxm/vqENp7gv0gS5t8L+ZD7Nmd\ndJmwpBWLF3cRotnTOP/NO2d1GfPP/LogdMkHhHAhyfhOFrmAVJq5gmq2e5FmANrB\n/7QLLIfXBhQ9e44OiNwZ5+Xjti8mw2QbsIFOsLDP6r58EEQslSw=\n=hgeD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:42:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/f613dcf5382db92911804e7dd9b7a5f941bc7709","node_id":"C_kwDONzcdMtoAKGY2MTNkY2Y1MzgyZGI5MjkxMTgwNGU3ZGQ5YjdhNWY5NDFiYzc3MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commit/bda46a1f3e36e270a159582915caf3ad2d980ffd","sha":"bda46a1f3e36e270a159582915caf3ad2d980ffd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/bda46a1f3e36e270a159582915caf3ad2d980ffd"}],"sha":"f613dcf5382db92911804e7dd9b7a5f941bc7709","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/f613dcf5382db92911804e7dd9b7a5f941bc7709"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/aa0df3906469dab2607c7caeded8fc39f73db8e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:03:27Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:03:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: disable domain Refresh during cooldown and lowercase empty-state titles (#1600)\n\n## Summary\n\nTwo small fixes from feedback.\n\n**Domain Refresh cooldown.** A domain can only be refreshed once every 5\nminutes. Clicking Refresh sooner showed the raw API validation error:\n\"Must be at least 5m after the previous\ndesiredRegistrationRefreshAttempt when changed\". Refresh is now disabled\nduring the cooldown, both in the domain detail header and in the domains\nlist row actions. A tooltip explains why: \"Domains can be refreshed once\nevery 5 minutes. Try again in 4 minutes.\" In the header it re-enables on\nits own when the time is up.\n\n<img width=\"615\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-29 at 17 59 51\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b4b7828-6c5e-49f2-98b4-f1026db7596a\"\n/>\n\n\n**Empty-state capitalisation.** datum-ui''s `EmptyContent` puts \"Hey\nthere, \" in front of every title, so capitalised titles read as \"Hey\nthere, Try adjusting your search or filters\". Titles passed to it now\nstart lowercase, the way the \"let''s create your first…\" ones already\ndid. Acronyms such as DNS and service names keep their capitals. This\ncovers the shared table and card-list defaults (no items, failed to\nload, search or filter misses) plus DNS records, DNS import,\nnameservers, quotas, connectors, access tokens, active sessions, org\nbilling projects and service account roles.","tree":{"sha":"170d60540e6dc97bdfbb0006e516ecbec65cf965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/170d60540e6dc97bdfbb0006e516ecbec65cf965"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/aa0df3906469dab2607c7caeded8fc39f73db8e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 170d60540e6dc97bdfbb0006e516ecbec65cf965\nparent 956e3e643d8f5e3fcf8dc74afd33b827ad0c0c0a\nparent 0e3d8e2e3aae1615ee6342c124d74435c7062f9c\nauthor Matt Jenkinson <75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com> 1790784207 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790784207 +0100\n\nfix: disable domain Refresh during cooldown and lowercase empty-state titles (#1600)\n\n## Summary\n\nTwo small fixes from feedback.\n\n**Domain Refresh cooldown.** A domain can only be refreshed once every 5\nminutes. Clicking Refresh sooner showed the raw API validation error:\n\"Must be at least 5m after the previous\ndesiredRegistrationRefreshAttempt when changed\". Refresh is now disabled\nduring the cooldown, both in the domain detail header and in the domains\nlist row actions. A tooltip explains why: \"Domains can be refreshed once\nevery 5 minutes. Try again in 4 minutes.\" In the header it re-enables on\nits own when the time is up.\n\n<img width=\"615\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-29 at 17 59 51\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b4b7828-6c5e-49f2-98b4-f1026db7596a\"\n/>\n\n\n**Empty-state capitalisation.** datum-ui''s `EmptyContent` puts \"Hey\nthere, \" in front of every title, so capitalised titles read as \"Hey\nthere, Try adjusting your search or filters\". Titles passed to it now\nstart lowercase, the way the \"let''s create your first…\" ones already\ndid. Acronyms such as DNS and service names keep their capitals. This\ncovers the shared table and card-list defaults (no items, failed to\nload, search or filter misses) plus DNS records, DNS import,\nnameservers, quotas, connectors, access tokens, active sessions, org\nbilling projects and service account roles.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvTLPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2e0QABOgI1UIoHtT18drxLYr5u91\npNpyETccBFfcQuZji1FtqqATnyIYzoD6PhbtCLRSMFuiW3HGQlMYxKOXgQ+g65UC\naGBRTxcJg6IKT1aG21xWTtAF9OL0+lJGRYBjPZLbi4jQZ6zC/xGCsA+bu40YMgWC\nx6ViOfmMCBmg/5EvwVPglnJKe4fx4aDR/6MEQ9Bu8ZiRs5JvDWtcsier/bx53AdT\nGZRTKxV7U7pUz1jgroN418f/lnBeI6HijTiyvukNOEO70eVM/jFck7gnvG679oBZ\nrpQglf8y8O4VdcPgKFDeT6uYxlYBPkJCLqK7FDRnn4tU1iYmLlmpDHIhkwlqFFst\nICqPTpTzFDZrdkqyuIIJ1AMy3TRqx7iJsKM/OUJlQ7ozOa98hTFObVCq1wtAzNby\nhitsGtGmcu1BHDULRFNQBk8cTpVANPJst37n66yS1mscBnym3l2sOiCTIjzIK/Wj\nVw1qj116MiSKXKYvBNTZMJHsmN2uPf4G5bXXDZIhtKtMTNJL7U93ROWa/UEs9Aoz\nBSnxWI8ayICWocD6IaC9BoZW2ZDiRTttXrpBxBZS3ZK7ydYVW2gp360ozJwo3j1j\nEJY5KoSC//pVkQdBs2BYoBV1YeQBwHs3x6cuFUWnkPSjH6A3hxAwxstGI86bWwcA\nsjWBu6pW50NbOLNiqyiK\n=N0Zb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:03:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist