ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/bda46a1f3e36e270a159582915caf3ad2d980ffd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:13:55Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:13:55Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"fix(project): Adapt home to the dock and entitlements\n\nTwo changes from main needed follow-up on the new home page:\n\n- The content column is now a named container that narrows when a\n  dock panel opens. The home grids, traffic tiles and health bar used\n  viewport breakpoints and squashed with the panel open; they now use\n  `@…/main` container queries like the rest of the page.\n- The Quotas page hides gated services a project isn''t entitled to.\n  The home Quotas column and health bar read quotas on the client, so\n  they still listed them. They now share a hook that applies the same\n  `isServiceVisible` rule, and hide nothing while entitlements are\n  unknown, as the server-side filter does.","tree":{"sha":"8910ba4e70b9a984ed07c7a89984b8844bc9e7dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/8910ba4e70b9a984ed07c7a89984b8844bc9e7dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/bda46a1f3e36e270a159582915caf3ad2d980ffd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at