ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:02:48Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"refactor(quotas): trim hidden rows'' registrations and drop the unused owner field\n\nQuota rows carried a serviceName nothing read once filtering moved into\nthe loaders, and resolving it meant working out the owner twice per row.\nThe field is gone. The loader filter now also drops the registrations\nthat only described hidden buckets, so the response carries nothing about\nservices the scope cannot see.","tree":{"sha":"477516d3b164dc98035e490b9074d434e5acf865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/477516d3b164dc98035e490b9074d434e5acf865"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/5704d48faab0b52f730633e47b40cc7c59c909ce","verification":{"payload":"tree 477516d3b164dc98035e490b9074d434e5acf865\nparent 64aba84228d44fcf3f0986bc4799242667ea36fb\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790769768 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790769768 +0700\n\nrefactor(quotas): trim hidden rows'' registrations and drop the unused owner field\n\nQuota rows carried a serviceName nothing read once filtering moved into\nthe loaders, and resolving it meant working out the owner twice per row.\nThe field is gone. The loader filter now also drops the registrations\nthat only described hidden buckets, so the response carries nothing about\nservices the scope cannot see.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmq8+mwbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4j3pUP/RsXE4zIEcG6kkqPoAFY\n7CDrD4S0BQe1PWrqQQsMbD5wFVbcRXsua7it6YhNDiEk/WO8gaIZZWrO0pTkXi3l\n0IAvomVdHaltWSeGBpjx1XdqeqV8VzfUbUen2xSqkf9+pnWapN0CRwzrRsc7Oym3\n3l6bL4om3lGlPe7fSpjHVGLmzbo8/dYvqc5Y27BA+mKEcEwYjBjxfs1m9+C/HzJO\nddbyaWeYjjBSMiDHDhmKdSMFVtHG76SmS2cFLAAFSHCoeZzsjxW1k7OavBcBmcQZ\nwz/xC3mT8rTUmzYPUqlde716eK6gA11VQapTPrHKhNx+2kg