users/yahyafakhroji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/e8cd20989bb7085d1b7032722263aebca92cab19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:43:45Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:43:45Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"refactor(entitlements): filter quotas in the loaders and share one scope rule\n\nReview of the entitlement filtering found the project-scope decision\nwritten twice, the quota row build living untested inside a component,\nand the owning service resolved twice per row. The usage route now reuses\nthe loader''s exported project selector. Quota rows are built by\nbuildQuotaRows in the grouping module, with tests, and both quota loaders\ndrop unentitled gated buckets before responding so hidden rows never ship\nto the client and the table no longer needs an entitlement prop. The\ngated-service set moves into the entitlements module behind a type guard,\nso the module no longer reaches into the quotas feature.","tree":{"sha":"326a863e7d5ee85c524cd7146ee1156750b456f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/326a863e7d5ee85c524cd7146ee1156750b456f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/e8cd20989bb7085d1b7032722263aebca92cab19","verification":{"payload":"tree 326a863e7d5ee85c524cd7146ee1156750b456f6\nparent 8cc1a888795b177f5104f1fa7006e0801eda3c11\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790768625 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790768625 +0700\n\nrefactor(entitlements): filter quotas in the loaders and share one scope rule\n\nReview of the entitlement filtering found the project-scope decision\nwritten twice, the quota row build living untested inside a component,\nand the owning service resolved twice per row. The usage route now reuses\nthe loader''s exported project selector. Quota rows are built by\nbuildQuotaRows in the grouping module, with tests, and both quota loaders\ndrop unentitled gated buckets before responding so hidden rows never ship\nto the client and the table no longer needs an entitlement prop. The\ngated-service set moves into the entitlements module behind a type guard,\nso the module no longer reaches into the quotas feature.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmq89fUbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4jLwoP/jAXiQncNPe8Dh0LCBKz\n0ZGde4x0LfTC+UgEiYdJ+TA6T+A4juXtHNmrNPMksUR2DRjg26cLAqIrzv9Jm1Q1\nn2P82hxeqNWE+ss6V92dQm+qsKebLqCX+z2Z0PWc2peLY3GtRA6Yk5TpSiAox2rP\n+niUFmJHl8nCq5BZXwjfTLyOPPkthJ5swOxOS2USvslij7F69/CBnAc5ABSXkWZg\nsuj/TIu7+OvVSOOItuVpTtK6pLYSBItFsXuxZ2jTpfzK6DO1dogt+3pS30R81+Sc\ndACztuBMDgODrxeHHD9V7RCy77pWRw6taqwjwTbwblNtXV0LNBv+EYh/+rxjbKJd\nJXazGEiZPNK4tFioM2ViATQQAaNsKkMhvAertOlY4/cj68IGXm7VwTocaCd+vR61\nmrNDqlZNE3N8qfaFqA/V7x8NFcRB/jkaCN9csWX+VCgqNCUrBAPuGA28q7ys50R9\n6+ctJTHamozQKRYlkmFyVDWRLq8a5fRl37/Aq6wu+oR0UcNH1EiUL8wkHKGTjqZx\n9H41FK5QI5jw4nMGknOzMxHZw6WH0Pt0YQebXGu8mUdW51sFkFLP0xWYVbBme7Bt\nk3ip1LZw2PMcEwrGrov3+MFa2Rl3ompv6vHUGD8YZ9B1fOGC157cHxGueQ8jUEkb\nMjkQaZzCmKqb9LaazLvICvum\n=v3DC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T11:43:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3510868?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/gists{/g