false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/commits/8cc1a888795b177f5104f1fa7006e0801eda3c11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:31:43Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:31:43Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"feat(quotas): hide gated services the scope is not entitled to\n\nThe Quotas pages grouped rows by service but showed gated services such\nas Compute regardless of entitlement. Quota rows now carry their owning\nservice, the route loaders resolve Active entitlements for the project or\nacross the org''s projects, and the table drops rows whose service is\ngated and unentitled. Platform services such as Billing and\nOrganization & Projects are never gated and always show.","tree":{"sha":"413519f03e85e0206a3486f44275dace209e91da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/413519f03e85e0206a3486f44275dace209e91da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/8cc1a888795b177f5104f1fa7006e0801eda3c11","verification":{"payload":"tree 413519f03e85e0206a3486f44275dace209e91da\nparent 7ff26a0dc993cadea95725fb1a133462f511a7c1\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790767903 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790767903 +0700\n\nfeat(quotas): hide gated services the scope is not entitled to\n\nThe Quotas pages grouped rows by service but showed gated services such\nas Compute regardless of entitlement. Quota rows now carry their owning\nservice, the route loaders resolve Active entitlements for the project or\nacross the org''s projects, and the table drops rows whose service is\ngated and unentitled. Platform services such as Billing and\nOrganization & Projects are never gated and always show.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmq88yMbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4jAekP/1j+ng8ctox+g3u2NUAq\nHjjq3GoNGn8YpDdqhUvzYJZKraV6S1ekqFXP1pt+GeEAOtMqbxnRwNgKxwFkgDjW\neXVRt1pA9iiiUvoZx2MC5/8atuk++kLj7Wdaikz4qT8HO5sYD1QZQ4MvMb4sYgD0\n4AEnX6q++kIerrzBAhwHws7C9EP788Qq7Niyl5ao7n4D320pqWYXdX3CEuCeaalD\n70cAysmQ+qTDkQFzYv1Fsv317UsX6Gz1Ux23IzQRRB+PJbhHe0X379waYYWJjRhH\nWBkzpLfjA+Olv7YFzGS65eLBWngptlEjCbpgxfxrr/NvpNJcPw3CLw4MAFITQjeE\nX/XxZmakSF9h3jyBshmoQaHrlPI+P2G1ysWEb/b8AIR5hVP+jtFjfkwlw79HrPDo\nC3HILXzRxKeLc0BqMybKbGPeCVj7dP4ZOZFHAtQPn1ewFqqs8rfma3KgP6Tq4b4A\nIrYHHbdTa7sH2aP9F+WYQJIo8APvsJ1Kmre918QNq4aOFCQusYE9v6u1qVqsgAed\ni80i6AMWFf6dnKhnx0UfcjTcJWoeZAK4IpvJUIZb4Z6uJvhrxUynhvzGJr6nol6T\nuBs2+ubnuhCr2woyTh9rAsiuoz49VVwnzKX8gpVLJQgIob4/lCUvOzJi6PbqkxSr\n6zcbH1wFtis+ff/kr2B6tdtj\n=bIny\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T11:32:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3510868?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yahyafakhroji","id":3510868,"login":"yahyafakhroji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA4Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhro