mitter":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:31:39Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"feat(usage): hide gated services the scope is not entitled to\n\nThe Usage dashboard listed a Compute section for projects with no\ncompute entitlement. The BFF route already lists the org''s projects, so\nit now resolves Active entitlements for the projects in scope, the\nselected project or every project for the org view, and the loader drops\ngated groups and their meters before responding. A failed or empty lookup\nleaves the dashboard unfiltered.","tree":{"sha":"4e75a43e176c14e53bdd5eef9acf121401acc33f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/trees/4e75a43e176c14e53bdd5eef9acf121401acc33f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/cloud-portal/git/commits/7ff26a0dc993cadea95725fb1a133462f511a7c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e75a43e176c14e53bdd5eef9acf121401acc33f\nparent a62a028f20101aa7882bd2d8435d747f18530b43\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790767899 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790767899 +0700\n\nfeat(usage): hide gated services the scope is not entitled to\n\nThe Usage dashboard listed a Compute section for projects with no\ncompute entitlement. The BFF route already lists the org''s projects, so\nit now resolves Active entitlements for the projects in scope, the\nselected project or every project for the org view, and the loader drops\ngated groups and their meters before responding. A failed or empty lookup\nleaves the dashboard unfiltered.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmq88x4bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4jUAYP/3JlewoCXvMKmJ6H0GTR\n4L2N7BFU5MT5rq7mp1FdrHxcWECvi562i4x3TBzZc9EBkOBvZq00JZhNTf0Ac2Y0\nnuWVytSOovEx8e2L/ZxFfgljoCtBAqSTcV8F8EPxdEtGTpLg9Q7LYBwb5s90pWrp\n2ZiBaVCaQLO+q6xbC1X4lCsBKWxPd5a/TG7iPY95Oq8/aE0AuaSs31IuD3fExFTE\n0jsiZC5nQewCfmXCqpthJHKT9Eg8fVuC1