thubusercontent.com/u/96616262?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rk4rohankumar","id":96616262,"login":"rk4rohankumar","node_id":"U_kgDOBcI_Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rk4rohankumar/news-child-app/commits/b83f6be9c29006d38423e171a740efca2e9396b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:35:07Z","email":"rwpmns@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:35:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: make the News remote shell-ready (#1)\n\nThe host loads this remote at runtime (remoteEntry.js + container.init with\nits own share scope), so the remote must negotiate shared modules before\nanything evaluates, and must not hard-code where its chunks live.\n\n- craco: react, react-dom, framer-motion and axios are singletons with\n  requiredVersion from package.json; tailwindcss and eager:true removed.\n  output.publicPath is ''auto'' in production so chunks resolve relative to\n  wherever remoteEntry.js is served; dev keeps CRA''s ''/''.\n- Async bootstrap: src/index.js -> import(''./bootstrap'') so shared\n  singletons are resolved before React renders. The standalone shell\n  supplies <main>; the exposed App renders a <section> to avoid a nested\n  main landmark inside the host.\n- Article media: fixed 16:9 wrapper so cards never shift; lazy/async\n  images with descriptive alt; failed images fall back to the gradient\n  header, failed/tiny favicons to an inline SVG placeholder; favicon uses\n  a 1x/2x srcset.\n- Headline is now the link (with an sr-only \"opens in a new tab\" hint)\n  instead of a \"Read more\" link whose aria-label hid its visible text.\n- CRA leftovers removed (logo/favicon assets, App.css, tests,\n  reportWebVitals); index.html/manifest carry a real title, description,\n  theme-color and an inline SVG favicon.\n- REACT_APP_NEWS_API_KEY was dead since the NewsAPI -> HN/Spaceflight\n  switch; .env.example and the ErrorState hint are gone, README rewritten.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12b71ef0cba9fc7cf383b21a26ca8e8d4429cd36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rk4rohankumar/news-child-app/git/trees/12b71ef0cba9fc7cf383b21a26ca8e8d4429cd36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rk4rohankumar/news-child-app/git/commits/b83f6be9c29006d38423e171a740efca2e9396b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 12b71ef0cba9fc7cf383b21a26ca8e8d4429cd36\nparent 377fca3d47305207b651ac86bc77793fc1119dd3\nauthor Rohan Kumar <rwpmns@gmail.com> 1790915707 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790915707 +0530\n\nfeat: make the News remote shell-ready (#1)\n\nThe host loads this remote at runtime (remoteEntry.js + container.init with\nits own share scope), so the remote must negotiate shared modules before\nanything evaluates, and must not hard-code where its chunks live.\n\n- craco: react, react-dom, framer-motion and axios are singletons with\n  requiredVersion from package.json; tailwindcss and eager:true removed.\n  output.publicPath is ''auto'' in production so chunks resolve relative to\n  wherever remoteEntry.js is served; dev keeps CRA''s ''/''.\n- Async bootstrap: src/index.js -> import(''./bootstrap'') so shared\n  singletons are resolved before React renders. The standalone shell\n  supplies <main>; the exposed App renders a <section> to avoid a nested\n  main landmark inside the host.\n- Article media: fixed 16:9 wrapper so cards never shift; lazy/async\n  images with descriptive alt; failed images fall back to the gradient\n  header, failed/tiny favicons to an inline SVG placeholder; favicon uses\n  a 1x/2x srcset.\n- Headline is now the link (with an sr-only \"opens in a new tab\" hint)\n  instead of a \"Read more\" link whose aria-label hid its visible text.\n- CRA leftovers removed (logo/favicon assets, App.css, tests,\n  reportWebVitals); index.html/manifest carry a real title, description,\n  theme-color and an inline SVG favicon.\n- REACT_APP_NEWS_API_KEY was dead since the NewsAPI -> HN/Spaceflight\n  switch; .env.example and the ErrorState hint are gone, README rewritten.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvzR7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI5oQAGIQnIRlE3BDGFmtLs4IqaA/\nFkgpnhVvGo2rpLKB7ox85VhGN5KvyURdQEx0hNQ5zHb/XmaZGJnjtZUjPJjhdSwZ\n/lG6O7P+ZONI0/cGekXobM+RvgPjYJRR68BqvfeDYJs9mo22Kv22MjwaLcWkSMdj\n2IWqeiE8Fx/NXUwi23Qy8pJ/NXr/GFQjknIae3OESm07vLitFSohYdubNZJRuuM0\n4gHGR/0Sf3thRjFdDOlvv2NtOed9OP9Oc+Dtsj29p5Q7X8He8XRvDbZk21Bxgqlw\nIudRblnLl3jpTz7StrjdrkTTd4PA7fJDRnVMFetQhf8z4lK62mQS2V1k5jerUpJH\nDK2kl0yREs607uP1CVWSIQJf8Rd8zdGZGvqpy5Bp5NdWku49TzaZOX74tDCPg2kX\nxS6HO4i6dBCTDBhH2qnSGiyAj+K2LNnxbhsgw3z3NzKFMT7oJGIz19h2DuhKOFvS\nCFgTfOzdPFCTCrsfggT+wv31NYzM6DxMTB48x2uHR+L2AU5Bco2pYwJCgpHIBZAZ\n9fpS6XOGnIdNf3/EALXYAiw9/l7KGrk6qliroTg+5sip7MHH9085GgC2cTx9HIsV\nl0c2keCxzqgG07HjaygLQKaCw2ckqxPVgbVI67tN5IR2iObzk5Y350WG3gBbgla8\na09UmbtrFCtaPc6v6lKH\n=3BNB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T04:35:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user