umar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rk4rohankumar/news-child-app/commits/5b1e1105d321a5b6fba0b219dfb6727b8bfaef57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T14:44:02Z","email":"rwpmns@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T14:44:02Z","email":"rwpmns@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Kumar"},"message":"fix: replace NewsAPI with browser-friendly public APIs\n\nNewsAPI developer plan blocks all non-localhost browser requests.\nSwap for two key-free, CORS-enabled sources:\n\n- Hacker News via Algolia: top stories, tech, Ask HN, Show HN\n- Spaceflight News API: space & science with images\n\nNormalize both responses into a common article shape.\nArticleCard falls back to a gradient header when no image is available\n(HN items usually lack images); deduped meta line shows HN points/comments.\n\nNo API key required anymore; .env.example kept for reference.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"704eea8dd1d9ac542734ff0ac9057ea21eff8a9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rk4rohankumar/news-child-app/git/trees/704eea8dd1d9ac542734ff0ac9057ea21eff8a9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rk4rohankumar/news-child-app/git/commits/5b1e1105d321a5b6fba0b219dfb6727b8bfaef57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96616262?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rk4rohankumar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"ht