comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalmanK81099/micro-app-arch-redux-expo/commits/67819a3e31711013905be178ea26bb86e82ea26f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:12:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:12:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Rewrite the README and make its instructions verifiable\n\nThe README only documented the Redux layer and never explained the micro-app\ncomposition that the repo exists to demonstrate. Several of its claims were also\nwrong. Rewrites it around what the code actually does, and fixes the tooling that\nthe new instructions revealed as broken.\n\nCorrections to previously documented behaviour\n- The payments reducer key is `paymentSettings`, not `settings`\n- Store hooks are not exported from `@micro/features-*`; those barrels export only\n  screens and widgets. The real path is `@micro/features-*/src/store`\n- There is no payments `CombinedStoreProvider`, and the support one does not combine\n  stores — it mounts the support store alone\n- No optimistic updates or automatic error clearing exist; the RTK Query\n  `onQueryStarted` handlers log and forward\n\nNew content\n- Explains route composition: how `combineContexts` merges several `require.context`\n  trees behind route prefixes so micro apps stay separately buildable\n- Repository layout, accurate Node range (^20.19.4 || ^22.13.0 || ^24.3.0 || >=25,\n  from React Native and Metro), per-app run commands\n- Root store state table with owners, quality-check commands, upgrade loop\n- Known issues section covering the CombinedStoreProvider gap, the shared `myapp`\n  scheme, and the unmaintained react-native-media-query dependency\n\nTooling fixes found while verifying the instructions\n- `yarn workspace <name> test` failed for every workspace: each package carried its\n  own `jest` preset block that bypassed the root config''s moduleNameMapper. Removes\n  those blocks so the root jest.config.js is the single source of truth, lists all\n  nine workspaces as projects, and points each workspace''s `test` script back at it\n  with `--selectProjects`. The scripts `cd` to the root first, because Jest resolves\n  the `@micro/*` workspace links relative to cwd\n- `expo lint` failed out of the box: adds the flat eslint config to all three apps,\n  escapes an unescaped apostrophe in each `+not-found.tsx`, and removes a dead\n  `microColors;` expression statement and its now-unused import from the host layout\n\nAdds a public API surface test asserting that every import path the README\nadvertises actually resolves — the class of breakage that hid the core-store\nentry-point bug from tsc.\n\nVerified: 46/46 tests pass, all workspaces typecheck, all three apps lint clean,\nand the host app still bundles for iOS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Wh4jtyskVrQkYwuiW5LcGP","tree":{"sha":"bd3b3059dfef0b09515a0d46310f71099f2fa112","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalmanK81099/micro-app-arch-redux-expo/git/trees/bd3b3059dfef0b09515a0d46310f71099f2fa112"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalmanK81099/micro-app-arch-redux-expo/git/commits/67819a3e31711013905be178ea26bb86e82ea26f","verification":{"payload":"tree bd3b3059dfef0b09515a0d46310f71099f2fa112\nparent ded688af309b22e0f5870ff8389438b328ed2d70\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789391529 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789391529 +0000\n\nRewrite the README and make its instructions verifiable\n\nThe README only documented the Redux layer and never explained the micro-app\ncomposition that the repo exists to demonstrate. Several of its claims were also\nwrong. Rewrites it around what the code actually does, and fixes the tooling that\nthe new instructions revealed as broken.\n\nCorrections to previously documented behaviour\n- The payments reducer key is `paymentSettings`, not `settings`\n- Store hooks are not exported from `@micro/features-*`; those barrels export only\n  screens and widgets. The real path is `@micro/features-*/src/store`\n- There is no payments `CombinedStoreProvider`, and the support one does not combine\n  stores — it mounts the support store alone\n- No optimistic updates or automatic error clearing exist; the RTK Query\n  `onQueryStarted` handlers log and forward\n\nNew content\n- Explains route composition: how `combineContexts` merges several `require.context`\n  trees behind route prefixes so micro apps stay separately buildable\n- Repository layout, accurate Node range (^20.19.4 || ^22.13.0 || ^24.3.0 || >=25,\n  from React Native and Metro), per-app run commands\n- Root store state table with owners, quality-check commands, upgrade loop\n- Known issues section covering the CombinedStoreProvider gap, the shared `myapp`\n  scheme, and the unmaintained react-native-media-query dependency\n\nTooling fixes found while verifying the instructions\n- `yarn workspace <name> test` failed for every workspace: each package carried its\n  own `jest` preset block that bypassed the root config''s moduleNameMapper. Removes\n  those blocks so the root jest.config.js is the single source of truth, lists all\n  nine workspaces as projects, and points each workspace''s `test` script back at it\n  with `--selectProjects`. The scripts `cd` to the root first, because Jest resolves\n  the `@micro/*` workspace links relative to cwd\n- `expo lint` failed out of the box: adds the flat eslint config to all three apps,\n  escapes an unescaped apostrophe in each `+not-found.tsx`, and removes a dead\n  `microColors;` expression statement and its now-unused import from the host layout\n\nAdds a public API surface test asserting that every import path the README\nadvertises actually resolves — the class of breakage that hid the core-store\nentry-point bug from tsc.\n\nVerified: 46/46 tests pass, all workspaces typecheck, all three apps lint clean,\nand the host app still bundles for iOS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Wh4jtyskVrQkYwuiW5LcGP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFYxB3+l\nvIu8aQDczr0+w5J0b9/MxtocVOpu4hnNwgHguTxlEl+SjJgtbvW54XyMI4yuZn+PJh4eNn5uT0v3\n0w0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SalmanK81099/micro-app-arch-redux-expo/commit/67819a3e31711013905be178ea26bb86e82ea26f","node_id":"C_kwDON0_6idoAKDY3ODE5YTNlMzE3MTEwMTM5MDViZTE3OGVhMjZiYjg2ZTgyZWEyNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SalmanK81099/micro-app-arch-redux-expo/commit/ded688af309b22e0f5870ff8389438b328ed2d70","sha":"ded688af309b22e0f5870ff8389438b328ed2d70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalmanK81099/micro-app-arch-redux-expo/commits/ded688af309b22e0f5870ff8389438b328ed2d70"}],"sha":"67819a3e31711013905be1