ions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/poly-micro-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/commits/fe5a7fd035052c041d1c6df620985490133c93c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-11T21:19:42Z","email":"rss.parser.bot@gmail.com","name":"poly-micro-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-11T21:19:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat: Refactor Dashboard Component (#58)\n\nThis pull request introduces significant updates to the application, including a major refactor of the dashboard layout, enhancements to the `ProjectSelector` component, and updates to release notes and testing. The changes aim to improve the structure, functionality, and user experience of the application.\r\n\r\n### Dashboard Refactor and Layout Enhancements:\r\n* Introduced a new `AppLayout` component to manage the overall application structure, including navigation, authentication, and routing (`src/components/layout/AppLayout.tsx`).\r\n* Added a `MainContent` component to dynamically render content based on the active tab, supporting features like scrollable and full-width layouts (`src/components/layout/MainContent.tsx`).\r\n* Defined constants for tab management (`TABS`, `SCROLLABLE_TABS`, `FULL_WIDTH_TABS`) to standardize behavior across the layout (`src/components/layout/constants.ts`).\r\n* Updated routing in `App.tsx` to replace `Dashboard` with `AppLayout` for all main routes (`src/App.tsx`). [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-26ad4b834941d9b19ebf9db8082bd202aaf72ea0ddea85f5a8a0cb3c729cc6f2L3) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-26ad4b834941d9b19ebf9db8082bd202aaf72ea0ddea85f5a8a0cb3c729cc6f2L54-R58)\r\n\r\n### `ProjectSelector` Component Enhancements:\r\n* Replaced the dropdown''s implementation to use a button-based design, improving accessibility and user experience (`src/__tests__/unit/components/common/ProjectSelector.test.tsx`). [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-e92b9e805e6f9e98ebe6f3901a4907e2d54dddaab2b320f3595d591f8d321d2cL53-R63) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-e92b9e805e6f9e98ebe6f3901a4907e2d54dddaab2b320f3595d591f8d321d2cL67-R89)\r\n* Updated tests to reflect the new dropdown behavior, using `userEvent` for better simulation of user interactions. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-e92b9e805e6f9e98ebe6f3901a4907e2d54dddaab2b320f3595d591f8d321d2cL53-R63) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-e92b9e805e6f9e98ebe6f3901a4907e2d54dddaab2b320f3595d591f8d321d2cL87-R116)\r\n\r\n### Release Notes and Metadata Updates:\r\n* Added release notes for version `1.12.0` and updated the `releases.json` file with detailed changes for the new version (`releases/releases.json`, `releases/changes.json`). [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-69a38bd2f3dda79366651033973791cf2d5d04af2ddd11962db6c99c32ae2ff4R3-R50) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0e1ce7387c884b02258cac5380f3319401a93c9efc2a2479ee749d8b3a34538bR2-R5)\r\n\r\n### Codebase Cleanup:\r\n* Removed unused imports and commented out the `Dashboard` tab in the `Sidebar` component (`src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx`). [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-6d581b4911012761e0ce28d8df437c4f41fe956b8fc6a176529a40964d11f4d9L4-R4) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-6d581b4911012761e0ce28d8df437c4f41fe956b8fc6a176529a40964d11f4d9L20-R24)\r\n* Exported new layout components (`AppLayout`, `MainContent`) and constants from the layout index file (`src/components/layout/index.ts`).","tree":{"sha":"69f6218718e6ea8fbf41f695747eb9ba2dbcfb67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/git/trees/69f6218718e6ea8fbf41f695747eb9ba2dbcfb67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/git/commits/fe5a7fd035052c041d1c6df620985490133c93c8","verification":{"payload":"tree 69f6218718e6ea8fbf41f695747eb9ba2dbcfb67\nparent 3274f3c0f723f793e50580808bdc7107b6f354f7\nparent d8322acc8e50774f10dbcdb415e70dbd60603d33\nauthor poly-micro-bot <rss.parser.bot@gmail.com> 1746998382 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746998382 +0300\n\nFeat: Refactor Dashboar