:0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-10T14:16:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat: Project structure cleanup (#44)\n\nThis pull request includes significant changes focused on removing SonarQube and SonarScanner integrations, cleaning up related configurations, and updating release management paths. Below is a categorized summary of the most important changes:\r\n\r\n### Removal of SonarQube and SonarScanner Integration:\r\n* Deleted all SonarQube-related configuration and scripts, including `docker-compose.sonarqube.yml`, `Dockerfile.sonarscanner`, `sonar-project.properties`, and supporting scripts (`scripts/run-sonarqube.sh`, `scripts/wait-for-sonarqube.sh`). [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-ab4bacf82443962eb1036901c63184fd4941cbbc2d3858a2a2762deb96df536eL1-L48) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-62883e8baf70569bb0e465695fedc536467830e7bb79aa2577063b47cffe2d08L1-L31) [[3]](diffhunk://#diff-43ed9d31bea2a6d518d69836bcd1a8e6bd81bf4df96c4745792c220ca5aa549cL1-L23) [[4]](diffhunk://#diff-2de53f1bd1d6f8af6ba25a9974a310b41340fef3e34ba6a2a974ceb6313c1612L1-L53) [[5]](diffhunk://#diff-8b81fee0d837cbdb26bd500307200330e2df12c0d5317ccbdac4cc64c99a412aL1-L55)\r\n* Updated `docs/for-developers/SONARQUBE.md` to reflect the removal of SonarQube and SonarScanner integration due to lack of TypeScript v5 support.\r\n\r\n### Streamlining E2E Testing:\r\n* Removed the Playwright testing setup, including the `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml`, and `playwright.config.ts` files. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-dd2c0eb6ea5cfc6c4bd4eac30934e2d5746747af48fef6da689e85b752f39557L1-L50) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-e45e45baeda1c1e73482975a664062aa56f20c03dd9d64a827aba57775bed0d3L1-L35) [[3]](diffhunk://#diff-f679bf1e58e8dddfc6cff0fa37c8e755c8d2cfc9e6b5dc5520a5800beba59a92L1-L36)\r\n* Updated `tsconfig.node.json` to exclude Playwright-related files from TypeScript compilation.\r\n\r\n### Release Management Updates:\r\n* Changed the default output path for release changes from `changes.json` to `releases/changes.json` in `.github/scripts/parse-commits.js` and `.github/workflows/release-update.yml`. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-73c1d404a8eb34aa6fd8dd2f0f1faaaf4a3f59ab10cec9ca8b0272e8864f5738L31-R31) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-9e60e4dab7fb21d28431bb11b62ab7ca32c15a9d74968b87ba9443af926636d2L58-R58)\r\n\r\n### Cleanup of Deprecated Files:\r\n* Removed outdated or unused files, including `Todo.md`, `changes.json`, and `scripts/changes.json`. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-4131babf3f1bed0b49c391684abcbfce84edbf9a0aa653e002140db2dacadd6fL1-L13) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-824239bc3fdc0b1eab78ebaa284667377a79995f561c683b1fd94dc90365756cL1-L10) [[3]](diffhunk://#diff-43979b4c7fc1333f08ceac3f268d327796936f4fdef3c97264cd75bec054175dL1-L18)\r\n\r\nThese changes streamline the project by removing unused or unsupported functionality and improving the organization of release-related files.","tree":{"sha":"8d59db36380b5a41bf352c1f273129966f2053a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/git/trees/8d59db36380b5a41bf352c1f273129966f2053a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/git/commits/026121dcd48abccd44247ffb6818aaa57b9bea70","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d59db36380b5a41bf352c1f273129966f2053a7\nparent 52d64627a21dc287b9d9ce687cf0441b2cb10484\nauthor Siryk Mykyta <115213079+siriknikita@users.noreply.github.com> 1746886568 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746886568 +0300\n\nFeat: Project structure cleanup (#44)\n\nThis pull request includes significant changes focused on removing SonarQube and SonarScanner integrations, cleaning up related configurations, and updating release management paths. Below is a categorized summary of the most important changes:\r\n\r\n### Removal of SonarQube and SonarScanner Integration:\r\n* Deleted all SonarQube-related configuration and scripts, including `docker-compose.sonarqube.yml`, `Dockerfile.sonarscanner`, `sonar-project.properties`, and supporting scripts (`scripts/run-sonarqube.sh`, `scripts/wait-for-sonarqube.sh`). [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-ab4bacf82443962eb1036901c63184fd4941cbbc2d3858a2a2762deb96df536eL1-L48) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-62883e8baf70569bb0e465695fedc536467830e7bb79aa2577063b47cffe2d08L1-L31) [[3]](diffhunk://#diff-43ed9d31bea2a6d518d69836bcd1a8e6bd81bf4df96c4745792c220ca5aa549cL1-L23) [[4]](diffhunk://#diff-2de53f1bd1d6f8af6ba25a9974a310b41340fef3e34ba6a2a974ceb6313c1612L1-L53) [[5]](diffhunk://#diff-8b81fee0d837cbdb26bd500307200330e2df12c0d5317ccbdac4cc64c99a412aL1-L55)\r\n* Updated `docs/for-developers/SONARQUBE.md` to reflect the removal of SonarQube and SonarScanner integration due to lack of TypeScript v5 support.\r\n\r\n### Streamlining E2E Testing:\r\n* Removed the Playwright testing setup, including the `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml`, and `playwright.config.ts` files. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-dd2c0eb6ea5cfc6c4bd4eac30934e2d5746747af48fef6da689e85b752f39557L1-L50) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-e45e45baeda1c1e73482975a664062aa56f20c03dd9d64a827aba57775bed0d3L1-L35) [[3]](diffhunk://#diff-f679bf1e58e8dddfc6cff0fa37c8e755c8d2cfc9e6b5dc5520a5800beba59a92L1-L36)\r\n* Updated `tsconfig.node.json` to exclude Playwright-related files from TypeScript compilation.\r\n\r\n### Release Management Updates:\r\n* Changed the default output path for release changes from `changes.json` to `releases/changes.json` in `.github/scripts/parse-commits.js` and `.github/workflows/release-update.yml`. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-73c1d404a8eb34aa6fd8dd2f0f1faaaf4a3f59ab10cec9ca8b0272e8864f5738L31-R31) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-9e60e4dab7fb21d28431bb11b62ab7ca32c15a9d74968b87ba9443af926636d2L58-R58)\r\n\r\n### Cleanup of Deprecated Files:\r\n* Removed outdated or unused files, including `Todo.md`, `changes.json`, and `scripts/changes.json`. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-4131babf3f1bed0b49c391684abcbfce84edbf9a0aa653e002140db2dacadd6fL1-L13) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-824239bc3fdc0b1eab78ebaa284667377a79995f561c683b1fd94dc90365756cL1-L10) [[3]](diffhunk://#diff-43979b4c7fc1333f08ceac3f268d327796936f4fdef3c97264cd75bec054175dL1-L18)\r\n\r\nThese changes streamline the project by removing unused or unsupported functionality and improving the organization of release-related files.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoH1+oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0x0QAGnr1JXssOW6tq7fGugwB1Tr\nBfbMtM0Dm2JTrC4gPp86TYZQclF5yxEUY9kNYqgghe8UW6Vsa2w52zAwoJBiUyxe\n1VRZPElMIujD10iqjiY8kgwqcBAghhsLvxT4ZHh/QmGaMw1dBMgWLjQHY14kcIRb\nCs6U/bPD9y6sO3XOKA5pgwyqFxmzTQYaiioxCtpiJSTOzisyL9sRuDH0GFkcA2Vw\nnlUQnHqCMjZs+eFDEw2o07gT+fsorQwijPIY0sM/BJ48yfLOgpDppI97mpV73Ubn\ngc8GU/tLsofJOBouSJrU0marwVg8g0k/W2St4qdZ4DfWObDRcHDOeqTEz20qnx1s\n9a6Wz1H7EpTSEE03LmqlJ6lJsN0YBXkKcXf9TihKu9j5lknnUtLaHOj+VmZPRJG2\nYMOv9kjKWfRam5JR6v+E6nDDvKahONTwMDAG8yb5/CwyCGysA+UWRjHo8QoLQJ9D\npQyLdmfzxW6OEhAiLXHLeyHBeSElY4BB5MBlbw2YygGY1ojHQVo+oyfDKvswyMII\n7Pi7NiRGglv6vVvOLI6L7cEVtdrz/kx9HvHJmQ4jA61H0TmgdrrK2/AOACyrEEhm\nWMOmi4tt/ts+0rJcBsoTYzNXH4XwqKe1GYRZBAwVCyDXUwVemWbgPvDdqIoMAQEv\njza6NbSDsKqeSkqQ7D/l\n=tW1e\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-05-10T14:16:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a