/api.github.com/users/siriknikita/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/siriknikita","id":115213079,"login":"siriknikita","node_id":"U_kgDOBt4DFw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/siriknikita","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/commits/21eaaaf7389cd5193716c5f16bbfd7caeba95c7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-10T10:47:47Z","email":"115213079+siriknikita@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Siryk Mykyta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-10T10:47:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Chore: CI/CD pipeline cleanup (#40)\n\nThis pull request introduces several new scripts and updates to GitHub Actions workflows to automate and streamline processes, such as pull request handling, release management, and commit parsing. Key changes include adding new Node.js scripts for specific tasks, improving modularity by replacing inline logic with reusable scripts, and simplifying workflows by removing redundant jobs.\r\n\r\n### New Node.js Scripts for Automation:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/scripts/auto-merge-pr.js`](diffhunk://#diff-c75eb3b63075834ccc0341382b1db7c2ff8748a3cb3dc9939bafb103704df203R1-R97): Implements a script to automatically merge pull requests after validating their mergeability and ensuring all required checks pass. It also handles branch updates if necessary.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/check-pr-status.js`](diffhunk://#diff-d6ff5f149b78a6c12698eda180001bd7504fd1cd0b9c7ddf47e928c28c887816R1-R82): Adds a script to check the status of a pull request, waiting for checks to complete and retrying up to a configurable number of attempts.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/create-release-pr.js`](diffhunk://#diff-52e941c174fe9dfb04c0a3762439037356b77590fd7a4efccce6a927cc21efa0R1-R102): Automates the creation of release pull requests, including handling branch naming, PR creation, and extracting the PR number.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/parse-commits.js`](diffhunk://#diff-73c1d404a8eb34aa6fd8dd2f0f1faaaf4a3f59ab10cec9ca8b0272e8864f5738R1-R110): Parses git commit messages to generate a `changes.json` file categorizing commits by type (e.g., feature, fix, improvement, breaking).\r\n\r\n### Workflow Simplifications and Improvements:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/workflows/pr-checks.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-1da7a27709d11ac16eef3de8e46ed10672b7b1d63a790ffbcbd23a94b19efdcbL12-L39): Simplifies the pull request checks workflow by removing redundant jobs (`log-trigger`, `check-actor`, and `bot-success`) and replacing inline auto-merge logic with the new `auto-merge-pr.js` script. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-1da7a27709d11ac16eef3de8e46ed10672b7b1d63a790ffbcbd23a94b19efdcbL12-L39) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-1da7a27709d11ac16eef3de8e46ed10672b7b1d63a790ffbcbd23a94b19efdcbL61-R70)\r\n* [`.github/workflows/release-update.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-9e60e4dab7fb21d28431bb11b62ab7ca32c15a9d74968b87ba9443af926636d2L37-R38): Replaces inline commit parsing logic with the reusable `parse-commits.js` script, improving maintainability and reducing duplication.\r\n\r\n### Dependency Management:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/scripts/package.json`](diffhunk://#diff-e5ea8b43e7224507fa90f95658e62b02594e9b23c63fd13807a657d12993ab05R1-R10): Adds a `package.json` file to manage dependencies for the new scripts, including `@actions/core` and `@octokit/rest`.\r\n\r\n### Miscellaneous Updates:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/workflows/docs.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-9cf2000c53760d837a449f874e53f792819108d3a4bf346336d0f7d082deae2cL42-R44): Updates the path for the Docsify build script to reflect its relocation to `.github/scripts`.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/update-release.js`](diffhunk://#diff-e21ec6b867cf47c1909c59ba90bb1de88fa1d4bf3a54baea2c80b6d0928c7592L46-R46): Adjusts file paths in the renamed `update-release.js` script to align with its new location under `.github/scripts`.","tree":{"sha":"766953f7568f46c292596092f74d019869d41f0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/git/trees/766953f7568f46c292596092f74d019869d41f0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siriknikita/poly-micro-frontend-demo/git/commits/21eaaaf7389cd5193716c5f16bbfd7caeba95c7a","verification":{"payload":"tree 766953f7568f46c292596092f74d019869d41f0e\nparent 53e15ad958c8b18124d8e9fe35c9f1f13b3ee33d\nauthor Siryk Mykyta <115213079+siriknikita@users.noreply.github.com> 1746874067 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746874067 +0300\n\nChore: CI/CD pipeline cleanup (#40)\n\nThis pull request introduces several new scripts and updates to GitHub Actions workflows to automate and streamline processes, such as pull request handling, release management, and commit parsing. Key changes include adding new Node.js scripts for specific tasks, improving modularity by replacing inline logic with reusable scripts, and simplifying workflows by removing redundant jobs.\r\n\r\n### New Node.js Scripts for Automation:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/scripts/auto-merge-pr.js`](diffhunk://#diff-c75eb3b63075834ccc0341382b1db7c2ff8748a3cb3dc9939bafb103704df203R1-R97): Implements a script to automatically merge pull requests after validating their mergeability and ensuring all required checks pass. It also handles branch updates if necessary.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/check-pr-status.js`](diffhunk://#diff-d6ff5f149b78a6c12698eda180001bd7504fd1cd0b9c7ddf47e928c28c887816R1-R82): Adds a script to check the status of a pull request, waiting for checks to complete and retrying up to a configurable number of attempts.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/create-release-pr.js`](diffhunk://#diff-52e941c174fe9dfb04c0a3762439037356b77590fd7a4efccce6a927cc21efa0R1-R102): Automates the creation of release pull requests, including handling branch naming, PR creation, and extracting the PR number.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/parse-commits.js`](diffhunk://#diff-73c1d404a8eb34aa6fd8dd2f0f1faaaf4a3f59ab10cec9ca8b0272e8864f5738R1-R110): Parses git commit messages to generate a `changes.json` file categorizing commits by type (e.g., feature, fix, improvement, breaking).\r\n\r\n### Workflow Simplifications and Improvements:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/workflows/pr-checks.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-1da7a27709d11ac16eef3de8e46ed10672b7b1d63a790ffbcbd23a94b19efdcbL12-L39): Simplifies the pull request checks workflow by removing redundant jobs (`log-trigger`, `check-actor`, and `bot-success`) and replacing inline auto-merge logic with the new `auto-merge-pr.js` script. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-1da7a27709d11ac16eef3de8e46ed10672b7b1d63a790ffbcbd23a94b19efdcbL12-L39) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-1da7a27709d11ac16eef3de8e46ed10672b7b1d63a790ffbcbd23a94b19efdcbL61-R70)\r\n* [`.github/workflows/release-update.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-9e60e4dab7fb21d28431bb11b62ab7ca32c15a9d74968b87ba9443af926636d2L37-R38): Replaces inline commit parsing logic with the reusable `parse-commits.js` script, improving maintainability and reducing duplication.\r\n\r\n### Dependency Management:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/scripts/package.json`](diffhunk://#diff-e5ea8b43e7224507fa90f95658e62b02594e9b23c63fd13807a657d12993ab05R1-R10): Adds a `package.json` file to manage dependencies for the new scripts, including `@actions/core` and `@octokit/rest`.\r\n\r\n### Miscellaneous Updates:\r\n\r\n* [`.github/workflows/docs.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-9cf2000c53760d837a449f874e53f792819108d3a4bf346336d0f7d082deae2cL42-R44): Updates the path for the Docsify build script to reflect its relocation to `.github/scripts`.\r\n* [`.github/scripts/update-release.js`](diffhunk://#diff-e21ec6b867cf47c1909c59ba90bb1de88fa1d4bf3a54baea2c80b6d0928c7592L46-R46): Adjusts file paths in the renamed `update-release.js` script to align with its new location under `.github/scripts`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoHy7TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+rYQAJDXvoynVUdr2gnWYCRodGso\nGCWKDt8TRZUXNYSjknfYoJ738TRVs9CR0WtZGYqT/GR2hr+cKBGkn2HtS8hkv9eT\n9APwwLg90LVnriFaj1IMJY3WRJC8KD3P2XVtgSUcTrJikg+MGCbv5R62Qx5a13xy\nJk32p5qV2JdulKSKdeGTVXN+sOkp54uwJh+KW+JBO0rVRevkXBYm8UmYMAyUgq+7\nRN1tdPdqJLh3BUKtADM9N4LdKuMqcy6lakK+o1RLutJaVsbi7mkz48KXLnfANywN\npxhFviYVnRDVdAlf7qJVXqOQz65Q4mjNkWffYGyyKFT+8152bspWvXNfaSGYqXOp\n72nLe44H6NY7bQFK8PTwFqKutY1kz0ASPkTg0R3rrQ5Lu4e5SFJzTaWoEcJzuboN\n+qlIISY6gUR3K2ZTieIw2grcX74H6w4cVUeD7/vm9iQlU8376r3SRr8vrvso8ozU\nzkxiDrjj1acS9fzkbSf2KvPhCJrDhA0sFo5wj9fB5eexHHuvsiIrKk0CW5q308pj\n/BqKjbtgKZOpRYtKKgrH7h1Cdh1+FxAo6y39eTk/0kNBGEWA2OEQtK7l6d2uQZ5G\n8RrbbplOKqlPh+m7LuJQ+/Nzlnas0pg1/qr370lMyf+KKo98g7Mj5E7Om6Qc8aD3\npkqRoThSC+8VhZE/R3is\n=+4DV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-05-10T10:47:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/re